povedenti","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Parcheggio accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado","Equipos para personas con problemas de visi\u00f3n y audici\u00f3n","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Estacionamiento habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-03-06T02:37:27+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-15T11:50:01+01:00","backoffice_id":271755,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.35824508953516},{"id":545542,"date_start":"2023-01-23","date_end":"2023-04-30","date_next":"2023-03-07","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,40],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Arts graphiques"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Grafische kunst, vormgeving"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Graphic art"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Grafische K\u00fcnste"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Arti grafiche"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Artes gr\u00e1ficas"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"L'Art nouveau s'affiche !","shortdescr":"Une exposition d\u2019affiches patrimoniales et de cr\u00e9ation contemporaine valorisant l\u2019Art nouveau d\u2019hier \u00e0 aujourd\u2019hui.","longdescr":"A la Belle Epoque, l\u2019engouement pour l\u2019affiche est immense. Les plus grands artistes belges et bruxellois de l\u2019Art nouveau se sont ainsi illustr\u00e9s sur les murs de la ville, \u00e0 travers des affiches informatives, publicitaires, de promotion culturelles. Victor Horta, Privat Livemont, Paul Hankar, Henry Van de Velde, Victor Creten, Gustave Flasschoen, ont tous produit des \u0153uvres graphiques marquantes. L\u2019exposition L\u2019Art nouveau s\u2019affiche ! aura pour vocation de faire d\u00e9couvrir, par un m\u00e9dia \u00ab infiniment g\u00e9n\u00e9reux \u00bb , \u00e0 la fois l\u2019esth\u00e9tique Art nouveau, le g\u00e9nie de ses artistes-affichistes belges, et la ville de Bruxelles \u00e0 une \u00e9poque port\u00e9e par une id\u00e9ologie en r\u00e9action contre l\u2019industrialisation.\r\n\r\n\u00ab L\u2019Art nouveau s\u2019affiche ! \u00bb sera \u00e9galement un projet qui s\u2019\u00e9loignera d\u2019une approche classique et contemplative de l\u2019Art nouveau. En proposant \u00e0 des affichistes, typographes contemporains, graffeurs et tatoueurs de donner leur version 2023 de l\u2019affiche Art nouveau, l\u2019exposition cr\u00e9era un lien fort entre patrimoine Art nouveau et cr\u00e9ation contemporaine.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545542"},"nl":{"name":"Art nouveau tentoongesteld!","shortdescr":"Een tentoonstelling van historische en hedendaagse affiches die de Art nouveau van gisteren tot vandaag promoten.","longdescr":"Tijdens de Belle Epoque was de rage voor posters enorm. De grootste Belgische en Brusselse kunstenaars van de Art nouveau periode werden zo ge\u00efllustreerd op de muren van de stad, door middel van informatieve, reclame en culturele promotie affiches. Victor Horta, Privat Livemont, Paul Hankar, Henry Van de Velde, Victor Creten, Gustave Flasschoen, allen maakten opvallende grafische werken. Het doel van de tentoonstelling L'Art nouveau s'affiche! is de bezoekers via een \"oneindig genereus\" medium zowel de esthetiek van de Art Nouveau te laten ontdekken, als de genialiteit van de Belgische affichekunstenaars en de stad Brussel in een tijd waarin deze werd gedreven door een ideologie die zich afzette tegen de industrialisatie.\r\n\r\n\"Art nouveau on Display\" zal ook een project zijn dat afstapt van een klassieke en contemplatieve benadering van Art Nouveau. Door hedendaagse affichekunstenaars en typografen, graffitikunstenaars en tatoe\u00eberders uit te nodigen hun versie van de Art Nouveau 2023-affiche te geven, zal de tentoonstelling een sterke band leggen tussen het Art nouveau-erfgoed en de hedendaagse creatie.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545542"},"en":{"name":"Art nouveau on display!","shortdescr":"An exhibition of heritage and contemporary posters promoting Art nouveau from yesterday to today.","longdescr":"During the Belle Epoque, the craze for posters was immense. The greatest Belgian and Brussels artists of the Art nouveau period were thus illustrated on the walls of the city, through informative, advertising and cultural promotion posters. Victor Horta, Privat Livemont, Paul Hankar, Henry Van de Velde, Victor Creten, Gustave Flasschoen, all produced striking graphic works. The aim of the exhibition L'Art nouveau s'affiche! is to enable visitors to discover, through an \"infinitely generous\" medium, both the Art nouveau aesthetic and the art of the artist. The aim of the exhibition is to showcase the Art nouveau aesthetic, the genius of its Belgian poster artists, and the city of Brussels at a time when it was driven by an ideology that reacted against industrialisation.\r\n\r\n\"Art nouveau on Display\" will also be a project that moves away from a classical and contemplative approach to Art nouveau. By inviting contemporary poster artists and typographers, graffiti artists and tattoo artists to give their version of the Art nouveau 2023 poster, the exhibition will establish a strong link between the Art nouveau heritage and contemporary creation.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545542"},"de":{"name":"L'Art Nouveau s'affiche!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545542"},"it":{"name":"L'Art Nouveau s'affiche!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545542"},"sp":{"name":"L'Art Nouveau s'affiche!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545542"},"pt":{"name":"L'Art Nouveau s'affiche!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545542"},"cn":{"name":"L'Art Nouveau s'affiche!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545542"}},"place":{"id":247371,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Remarquable t\u00e9moin de l\u2019architecture des march\u00e9s couverts, les Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry  contribuent \u00e0 valoriser le patrimoine de la R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale. Centre d\u2019exposition et de manifestation bas\u00e9 en plein coeur du pentagone, elles ont pour vocation de mettre en valeur les traits de d\u00e9marcation du cadre de vie bruxellois et de son identit\u00e9 urbaine par le biais d'une programmation hybride, allant des expositions, aux conf\u00e9rences, concerts, rencontres et performances \u2026\r\nLe Centre Urbain (guichet d\u2019information r\u00e9gional, pour mieux vous conseiller sur l\u2019habitat durable en R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale) est \u00e9galement situ\u00e9 au sein des Halles.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Sint-Gorikshallen","address_street_name":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De Sint-Gorikshallen zijn een prachtig architecturaal staaltje van openbare markthallen in het 19de-eeuwse Brussel. Het gebouw werd een aantal jaren geleden volledig gerestaureerd en doet tegenwoordig dienst als permanente informatie-, tentoonstellings- en evenementenruimte gewijd aan het erfgoed en de levenswijzen in de hoofdstad. Op amper twee minuten stappen van de Beurs vormen de Sint-Gorikshallen een gezellige plek om te ontspannen en nieuwe dingen te ontdekken, zowel overdag als bij het vallen van de nacht.\r\nDe hallen herbergen ook de Stadswinkel, een vereniging die de inwoners van het Brussels Hoofdstedelijk Gewest  wil informeren over het leefmilieu en een kwaliteitsvolle leefomgeving, huisvesting, stadsrenovatie, stedenbouw en ruimtelijke ordening, en rationeel energiegebruik. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Saint-G\u00e9ry Market Halls are a fine architectural example of 19th-century public markets in Brussels. The building was completely restored several years ago and is now a permanent information and exhibition space, with urban planning, heritage, and urban renewal as its central themes.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry mit ihrer eklektischen Architektur wurden Ende des 19. Jahrhundert als Markthalle erbaut und spielten in der Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte eine wichtige Rolle.\r\n\r\nDie Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen waren einerseits sowohl legend\u00e4re als auch kaufm\u00e4nnische Wiege der Stadt. Ab dem 11. Jahrhundert stand an dieser Stelle eine dem Heiligen Saint-G\u00e9ry gewidmete Kapelle. Verschiedene Wohnh\u00e4user waren hier entstanden und aufgrund der N\u00e4he zur Senne entwickelten sich zahlreiche Aktivit\u00e4ten.\r\n\r\nIm 16. Jahrhundert erhielt die Kapelle den Status einer Pfarrkirche, die prachtvoll im gotischen Stil erweitert wurde, dann aber im Zuge der Franz\u00f6sische Revolution dem Erdboden gleichgemacht wurde.\r\n\r\nDer ehemalige Markt - und sogar das gesamte Saint-G\u00e9ry-Viertel \u2013 waren ihrerseits in den 1960er-Jahren von der Zerst\u00f6rung bedroht, bis das Viertel in den 1990er-Jahren eine Art zweiten Fr\u00fchling erlebte. Seit 1999 fungieren die Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen als Informations- und Ausstellungszentrum rund um die Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte und das st\u00e4dtische Leben in Br\u00fcssel. An der Bar gibt es Getr\u00e4nke und Speisen.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Halle di Saint-Gery","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi...\r\nLe Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi. Sotto il patrocinio della regione di Bruxelles Capitale.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Verdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio...\r\nVerdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio y al marco de vida de los bruselenses.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00