s for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Sound-amplifying equipment","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","H\u00f6rverst\u00e4rker","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Apparecchi acustici","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Aparatos de amplificaci\u00f3n del sonido","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-18T08:05:29+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-02T14:57:15+01:00","backoffice_id":270853,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":552556,"date_start":"2023-03-08","date_end":"2023-03-08","date_next":"2023-03-08","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert","it":"Concerti","sp":"Concierto","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"fr":["Classique"],"nl":["Klassiek"],"en":["Classical"],"de":["Klassisch"],"it":["Classica"],"sp":["Cl\u00e1sica"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Ensemble Nemesis  EP\u00f8Pe\u0307E","shortdescr":"Retour a\u0300 l\u2019e\u0301quilibre :\r\nl\u2019une des acceptions grecques de la de\u0301esse Ne\u0301me\u0301sis qui a inspire\u0301 leur nom.\r\n\r\nL\u2019Ensemble Nemesis voit tout d\u2019abord le jour comme quatuor de violoncelles. La rencontre des quatre violoncellistes avec Akram Ben Romdhane, oudiste sonne spontane\u0301ment comme une e\u0301vidence et fait nai\u0302tre l\u2019envie d\u2019e\u0301largir la formation.","longdescr":"Issus des quatre coins du monde (Tunisie, Espagne, Bre\u0301sil et France), ces musiciens aux profils tre\u0300s divers (pe\u0301dagogue, improvisateur, auteur\/compositeur, soliste de jazz, de musique classique et traditionnelle) trouvent instinctivement un terrain d\u2019entente : ouvrir un espace de lien vivant avec le public en composant leur propre musique.\r\n\r\nConside\u0301rant le son comme une matie\u0300re a\u0300 modeler, les musiciens prome\u0300nent leurs esprits hors des sentiers battus a\u0300 la recherche de l\u2019e\u0301motion ine\u0301dite, sans oublier de rendre hommage a\u0300 leurs pairs et aux origines pluri-centenaires de leurs instruments.\r\n\r\nEn 2022, l\u2019Ensemble Nemesis signe sa premie\u0300re cre\u0301ation collective : EP\u00f8Pe\u0307E","performers":"Akram Ben Romdhane, Erwan Le Guen, Diego Cardoso, Stann Duguet, Elvira Serrano-Rivas","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552556"},"nl":{"name":"Ensemble Nemesis  EP\u00f8Pe\u0307E","shortdescr":"Terug naar het evenwicht:\r\neen van de Griekse betekenissen van de godin Nemesis die hun naam inspireerde.\r\n\r\nHet Nemesis Ensemble begon als cellokwartet. De ontmoeting van de vier cellisten met Akram Ben Romdhane, een oud-speler, klonk spontaan en gaf aanleiding tot de wens om de groep uit te breiden.","longdescr":"Afkomstig uit de vier windstreken (Tunesi\u00eb, Spanje, Brazili\u00eb en Frankrijk), vinden deze musici met zeer uiteenlopende profielen (pedagoog, improvisator, auteur\/componist, solist in jazz, klassieke en traditionele muziek) instinctief een gemeenschappelijke basis: een ruimte openen voor een levende band met het publiek door hun eigen muziek te componeren.\r\n\r\nDe musici beschouwen geluid als een materiaal dat moet worden gevormd en gaan buiten de gebaande paden op zoek naar nieuwe emoties, zonder te vergeten hulde te brengen aan hun gelijken en aan de eeuwenoude oorsprong van hun instrumenten.\r\n\r\nIn 2022 tekent het Nemesis Ensemble zijn eerste collectieve creatie: EP\u00f8P\u0117E","performers":"Akram Ben Romdhane, Erwan Le Guen, Diego Cardoso, Stann Duguet, Elvira Serrano-Rivas","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552556"},"en":{"name":"Ensemble Nemesis  EP\u00f8Pe\u0307E","shortdescr":"Return to balance:\r\none of the Greek meanings of the goddess Nemesis that inspired their name.\r\n\r\nThe Nemesis Ensemble was first created as a cello quartet. The meeting of the four cellists with Akram Ben Romdhane, oudist, sounds spontaneously like an evidence and gives birth to the desire to widen the formation.","longdescr":"Coming from the four corners of the world (Tunisia, Spain, Brazil and France), these musicians with very different profiles (pedagogue, improviser, author\/composer, jazz, classical and traditional music soloist) instinctively find common ground: to open up a space for a living link with the public by composing their own music.\r\n\r\nConsidering sound as a material to be shaped, the musicians take their minds off the beaten track in search of new emotions, without forgetting to pay tribute to their peers and to the centuries-old origins of their instruments.\r\n\r\nIn 2022, the Nemesis Ensemble signs its first collective creation: EP\u00f8P\u0117E","performers":"Akram Ben Romdhane, Erwan Le Guen, Diego Cardoso, Stann Duguet, Elvira Serrano-Rivas","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552556"},"de":{"name":"Ensemble Nemesis  EP\u00f8Pe\u0307E","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552556"},"it":{"name":"Ensemble Nemesis  EP\u00f8Pe\u0307E","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552556"},"sp":{"name":"Ensemble Nemesis  EP\u00f8Pe\u0307E","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552556"},"pt":{"name":"Ensemble Nemesis  EP\u00f8Pe\u0307E","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552556"},"cn":{"name":"Ensemble Nemesis  EP\u00f8Pe\u0307E","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552556"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un lieu atypique et chaleureux dans le quartier de Tour & Taxis \u00e0 Bruxelles pour assister \u00e0 des concerts, des expositions, des projections ou des conf\u00e9rences, ou pour y organiser vos \u00e9v\u00e8nements priv\u00e9s.\r\nUn projet d\u00e9di\u00e9 au \u00ab beau \u00bb sous toutes ses coutures, dont les maitres-mots sont qualit\u00e9, \u00e9changes et rencontres.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Picardstraat, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De naam \"Baixu\" betekent \"mooi\" in de taal van de Pataxos indianen die in de zuidelijke staat Bahia (Brazili\u00eb) wonen. Dit woord staat voor de ambitie van het project en de kwaliteit van de culturele evenementen, maar ook voor de verbondenheid van de initiatiefnemers met de Braziliaanse cultuur. \r\nLe Baixu is ondergebracht in een voormalig industrieel gebouw in het hart van de trendy Brusselse Tour & Taxis wijk. Een atypische en warme plek bedoeld voor concerten, tentoonstellingen, filmvertoningen en conferenties en waar je ook priv\u00e9 evenementen kan organiseren. Het is een volledig uitgeruste, multidisciplinaire culturele ruimte met een oppervlakte van 150 m2, gewijd aan de \"schoonheid\" in al haar vormen. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","a