ion du conflit qui fait rage aux portes de l\u2019Europe. Le collectif, Congress of cultural activists, National Union of Artists of Ukrainia a proc\u00e9d\u00e9 \u00e0 une s\u00e9lection d\u2019\u0153uvres nous permettant de mieux comprendre la trag\u00e9die qui secoue leur pays et les tensions qui traversent leur \u0153uvre. \r\n\r\nQuand? Vernissage le jeudi 9 f\u00e9vrier \u00e0 18h \u00e0 la Maison des Arts. \r\nExposition du vendredi 10 f\u00e9vrier au dimanche 12 mars 2023 de 11h \u00e0 17h \u00e0 la Maison des Arts et au Centre culturel. \r\nO\u00f9? Maison des Arts, rue du Doyenn\u00e9 102 et Centre culturel d\u2019Uccle, rue Rouge 47\r\nQui? Tout public \r\nInfo : Gratuit - 02\/605.15.30 \u2013 culture@uccle.brussels","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.uccle.be","email":"culture@uccle.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 605 15 30","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550986"},"nl":{"name":"Invicibility Point, artistes d\u2019Ukraine aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.uccle.be","email":"culture@uccle.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 605 15 30","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550986"},"en":{"name":"Invicibility Point, artistes d\u2019Ukraine aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.uccle.be","email":"culture@uccle.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 605 15 30","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550986"},"de":{"name":"Invicibility Point, artistes d\u2019Ukraine aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.uccle.be","email":"culture@uccle.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 605 15 30","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.bru