osenboom","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552774"}},"place":{"id":235577,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA est un muse\u0301e, un centre d'archives, une bibliothe\u0300que et un lieu de rencontre pour les amateurs d'architecture, d'architecture paysage\u0300re, d'e\u0301cosyste\u0300mes urbains et d'histoire a\u0300 Bruxelles. Tout au long de l'anne\u0301e, vous pouvez vous y rendre pour des expositions temporaires, des confe\u0301rences, des de\u0301bats, des visites guide\u0301es, des lancements de livres et des activite\u0301s pour les enfants. Les activite\u0301s se trouvent a\u0300 Ixelles, pre\u0300s de la Place Flagey et au centre de Bruxelles, a\u0300 KANAL - Centre Pompidou.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Kluisstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Kluisstraat","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"CIVA is een museum, een archiefcentrum, een bibliotheek en een ontmoetingsplek voor liefhebbers van architectuur, landschapsarchitectuur, stadsecosystemen en geschiedenis in Brussel. Het hele jaar door kan je er terecht voor tijdelijke tentoonstellingen, lezingen, debatten, rondleidingen, book launches en kinderactiviteiten. De activiteiten vind je in Elsene, vlakbij het Flageyplein en in Brussel-centrum, in KANAL \u2013 Centre Pompidou.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA is a museum, an archive center, a library and a meeting place for lovers of architecture, landscape architecture, urban ecosystems and history in Brussels. Throughout the year, CIVA organizes temporary exhibitions, lectures, debates, guided tours, book launches and activities for children. The activities are organized in Ixelles, near Place Flagey and in the center of Brussels, in KANAL - Centre Pompidou.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das Architekturzentrum CIVA, das 2016 auf Betreiben der Region Br\u00fcssel-Hauptstadt ins Leben gerufen wurde, vereint in einer einzigen Struktur Ressourcen, Wissen und Know-how verschiedener Br\u00fcsseler Vereine aus dem Bereich Kultur, Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Landschaftsarchitektur und Forschungen zum \u00d6kosystem: die Archive f\u00fcr moderne Architektur, die Bibliothek Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, der Architekturfonds und das Centre Paul Duvigneaud.\r\nMit ihrem kulturellen Projekt tr\u00e4gt die Fondation CIA zur Entwicklung einer architektonischen, landschaftsarchitektonischen und st\u00e4dteplanerischen Kultur bei, die sich mit den Herausforderungen der Gegenwart auseinandersetzt. Schwerpunkt ist Br\u00fcssel. \r\n\r\nDie Fondation CIVA bietet eine ganze Reihe von Aktivit\u00e4ten und Angeboten: Ausstellungen, Konferenzen, Orte des Austauschs und der Debatten, p\u00e4dagogische Aktivit\u00e4ten, Archiveinblicke und Bibliotheken mit knapp 40.000 Werken und Zeitschriften zu den Themen Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Stadtgeschichte, Landschaften, G\u00e4rten und urbane \u00d6kosysteme.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Creado en 2016 por iniciativa de la Regi\u00f3n Bruselas-Capital, el CIVA re\u00fane una \u00fanica estructura de recursos, conocimiento y aprendizaje de varias asociaciones culturales activas en Bruselas en los campos de la arquitectura, urbanismo, paisajes y el estudio de ecosistemas: los Archivos de Arquitectura Moderna, la Biblioteca Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, los Fondos para la arquitectura, el Centro Paul Duvigneaud y el CIVA asbl, ahora disuelto.\r\nA trav\u00e9s de este proyecto cultural, la Fundaci\u00f3n CIVA contribuye al desarrollo del paisaje arquitect\u00f3nico y la cultura urbana como base para afrontar desaf\u00edos contempor\u00e1neos, poniendo especial \u00e9nfasis en Bruselas.\r\nSiempre tiene \u00e9xito a la hora de cumplir sus objetivos y tratar con un p\u00fablico amplio (adultos y ni\u00f1os, estudiantes, investigadores, arquitectos, paisajistas, amantes de la naturaleza, pol\u00edticos, etc), la fundaci\u00f3n CIVA organiza numerosos eventos y actividades en diferentes lugares, incluyendo exhibiciones permanentes y temporales, conferencias, debates y actividades educativas. Tambi\u00e9n dispone archivos excepcionales abiertos para todos los p\u00fablicos (documentos de arquitectos y paisajistas: planos, bocetos, modelos, muebles, etc.) y librer\u00edas que contienen casi 40.000 obras y peri\u00f3dicos de arquitectura, urbanismo, la historia de los pueblos y ciudades, paisajes, jardines y ecolog\u00eda urbana.\r\nEstas actividades y materiales est\u00e1n dise\u00f1ados para despertar la curiosidad y el inter\u00e9s de todo nuestro entorno, ya sea un hecho hist\u00f3rico o una construcci\u00f3n.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[5],"translations":{"fr":["Flagey"],"nl":["Flagey"],"en":["Flagey"],"de":["Flagey"],"it":["Flagey"],"sp":["Flagey"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"],"de":["S\u00fcden"],"it":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":1436,"location":{"lat":50.82873218,"lon":4.36569034},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-03-03T04:05:28+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:20+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":267246,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Explore.Brussels est un r\u00e9seau d'associations de visites guid\u00e9es \u00e0 Bruxelles. Cet organisme regroupe notamment ARAU, Arkadia, Bruxelles Bavard, Pro Velo, La Fonderie et Korei. les \u00e9v\u00e9nements sont organis\u00e9s en coproduction avec ces 6 entreprises  Les visites individuelles ou en groupe sont disponibles \u00e0 pied, \u00e0 v\u00e9lo, en car et en bateau.  Les visiteurs partent \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte du patrimoine de l'UNESCO, de Magritte, de l'art d\u00e9co, du chocolat et bien plus encore. Explore.Brussels organise \u00e9galement des festivals bruxellois et d'autres projets de grande envergure.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Brugmannlaan","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Ukkel","address_line1":"Brugmannlaan, 405","address_line2":"1180 Ukkel","description_web":"Explore.Brussels is een netwerk van verenigingen voor geleide bezoeken in Brussel. Deze organisatie omvat ARAU, Arkadia, Bruxelles Bavard, Pro Velo, La Fonderie en Korei. De evenementen worden georganiseerd in coproductie met deze 6 bedrijven. Individuele of groepstochten zijn mogelijk te voet, per fiets, per bus en per boot.  Bezoekers ontdekken UNESCO erfgoed, Magritte, art deco, chocolade en nog veel meer. Explore.Brussels organiseert ook Brusselse festivals en andere grootschalige projecten.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Explore.Brussels is a network of guided tour associations in Brussels. This organisation includes ARAU, Arkadia, Bruxelles Bavard, Pro Velo, La Fonderie and Korei. Events are organised in co-production with these 6 companies. Individual or group tours are available on foot, by bike, by bus and by boat.  Visitors discover UNESCO heritage, Magritte, art deco, chocolate and much more. Explore.Brussels also organises Brussels festivals and other large-scale projects.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Explore.Brussels ist ein Zusammenschluss von Vereinen, die qualitativ hochwertige Stadtf\u00fchrungen in der Region Br\u00fcssel-Hauptstadt organisieren.\r\nDie Mitgliedsvereine sind ARAU, Pro Velo, Brussels Chatterguides und Arkadia. Im Jahr 2020 hat sich La Fonderie als Partnerverein angeschlossen.\r\nEntdecken Sie das UNESCO-Weltkulturerbe, Jugendstilarchitektur, die Bauwerke von Victoria Horta, Gem\u00e4lde von Magritte, Comic-Kunst von Herg\u00e9, Streetart, Europa, Bier, Schokolade oder besichtigen Sie architektonische Perlen des Jugendstils, des Art-d\u00e9co oder des Neoklassizismus, die normalerweise nicht f\u00fcr die \u00d6ffentlichkeit zug\u00e4nglich sind. Die F\u00fchrungen werden sowohl f\u00fcr Einzelbesucher als auch f\u00fcr Gruppen angeboten und reichen von klassischen \u00fcber originelle bis hin zu vollkommen neuen Konzepten und Formaten. Neben Stadtf\u00fchrungen zu Fu\u00df sind auch Besichtigungen per Fahrrad, Bus oder Boot m\u00f6glich.\r\nExplore.Brussels organisiert unter anderem auch das Jugendstil- und Art-d\u00e9co-Festival BANAD, die Brussels Biennale - Neoclassic (BBN) sowie weitere Projekte, darunter die Ausbildung von Stadtf\u00fchrern, der \u201eVerein der Freunde\u201c und der \u201eVerein der Eigent\u00fcmer\u201c. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle"