past toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Menschen mit Verst\u00e4ndnisschwierigkeiten","Anpassungen f\u00fcr blinde und sehbehinderte Menschen","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","Assistenzhund","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile alle persone con difficolt\u00e0 di comprensione","Disposizioni per persone non vedenti e ipovedenti","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Cane guida","Parcheggio accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado para personas con dificultades de comprensi\u00f3n","Equipos para personas con problemas de visi\u00f3n y audici\u00f3n","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Perros gu\u00eda","Estacionamiento habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-22T13:35:10+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-22T13:08:03+01:00","backoffice_id":272324,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"concert","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":549897,"date_start":"2023-03-09","date_end":"2023-03-09","date_next":"2023-03-09","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":84,"translations":{"fr":"Divers","nl":"Varia","en":"Various","de":"Verschiedenes","it":"Varie","sp":"Varios","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[89],"translations":{"fr":["Litt\u00e9rature"],"nl":["Literatuur"],"en":["Litterature "],"de":["Literatur"],"it":["Letteratura"],"sp":["Literatura"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Rencontre avec Abdellah Ta\u00efa","shortdescr":"Une rencontre avec Abdellah Taia, l'\u00e9crivain et cin\u00e9aste marocain, autour de son dernier ouvrage \"Vivre \u00e0 ta lumi\u00e8re\"!","longdescr":"N\u00e9 \u00e0 Rabat en 1973, il vit \u00e0 Paris depuis 1999. Il est l\u2019auteur de plusieurs romans, publi\u00e9s aux \u00c9ditions du Seuil et traduits en Europe et aux \u00c9tats-Unis: \r\n\r\nL\u2019Arm\u00e9e du Salut (2006), Une m\u00e9lancolie arabe (2008), Le Jour du Roi\u201d (Prix de Flore 2010), Infid\u00e8les (2012), Un pays pour mourir\u201d (2015), Celui qui est digne d\u2019\u00eatre aim\u00e9\u201d (2017), La vie lente (2019) et Vivre \u00e0 ta lumi\u00e8re (2022). Il a r\u00e9alis\u00e9 en 2014 son premier film L\u2019Arm\u00e9e du Salut, d\u2019apr\u00e8s son roman \u00e9ponyme. Ce long-m\u00e9trage a \u00e9t\u00e9 s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 dans de nombreux festivals internationaux et a gagn\u00e9 plusieurs prix, dont le Grand Prix du Festival d\u2019Angers 2014.\r\n \r\nL\u2019Espace Magh vous invite \u00e0 une rencontre avec Abdellah Ta\u00efa autour de son nouveau livre Vivre \u00e0 ta lumi\u00e8re :\r\n \r\n\u00ab Trois moments dans la vie de Malika, une femme marocaine de la campagne. De 1954 \u00e0 1999. De la colonisation fran\u00e7aise \u00e0 la mort du roi Hassan II.\r\nSon premier mari est envoy\u00e9 par les Fran\u00e7ais combattre en Indochine.\r\nDans les ann\u00e9es 60, \u00e0 Rabat, elle fait tout pour emp\u00eacher sa fille Khadija de devenir bonne dans la villa de Monique.\r\nLa veille du d\u00e9c\u00e8s de Hassan II, un jeune voleur homosexuel, Ja\u00e2far, entre chez elle et veut la tuer.\r\nC\u2019est Malika qui parle ici. Tout le temps. Elle raconte avec rage ses strat\u00e9gies pour \u00e9chapper aux injustices de l\u2019Histoire. Survivre. Avoir une petite place.\r\nMalika, c\u2019est ma m\u00e8re : M\u2019Barka Allali Ta\u00efa (1930-2010). Ce livre lui est d\u00e9di\u00e9.\r\nA.T. \u00bb","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549897"},"nl":{"name":"Rencontre avec Abdellah Ta\u00efa","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549897"},"en":{"name":"Rencontre avec Abdellah Ta\u00efa","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549897"},"de":{"name":"Rencontre avec Abdellah Ta\u00efa","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549897"},"it":{"name":"Rencontre avec Abdellah Ta\u00efa","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549897"},"sp":{"name":"Rencontre avec Abdellah Ta\u00efa","sh