":{"fr":{"title":"Kheir Inch'Allah","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Kheir Inch'Allah","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Kheir Inch'Allah","copyright":null},"de":{"title":"Kheir Inch'Allah","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Kheir Inch'Allah","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Kheir Inch'Allah","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Kheir Inch'Allah","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Kheir Inch'Allah","copyright":null}}},{"type":"video","link":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/748448561","oEmbed_type":"video","oEmbed_version":"1.0","oEmbed_provider_name":"Vimeo","oEmbed_provider_url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/","oEmbed_title":"KHEIR INCH'ALLAH : LE TEASER !","oEmbed_author_name":"Le Rideau","oEmbed_author_url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/rideaubrussels","oEmbed_is_plus":"0","oEmbed_account_type":"pro","oEmbed_html":"<iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/748448561?h=1b0f3b2442&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen title=\"KHEIR INCH&amp;#039;ALLAH : LE TEASER !\"><\/iframe>","oEmbed_width":700,"oEmbed_height":394,"oEmbed_duration":104,"oEmbed_description":"Kheir Inch\u2019Allah\nYousra Dahry \/ Mohamed Ouachen \n27 sept. \u2192 1 oct.\n\nD\u00e8s 10 ans\n\n\nYousra 33 ans revient avec humour et tendresse sur l\u2019\u00e9ducation que son p\u00e8re lui a donn\u00e9e. \nUne \u00e9cole \u00e0 laquelle se greffe le drarisme, une autre \u00e9cole toute aussi importante : Le drarisme, la mentalit\u00e9 port\u00e9e par les jeunes des quartiers populaires, les Draris.\n\nCette \u00e9ducation d\u00e9teint sur ses relations avec les hommes, sujet qu\u2019elle d\u00e9cortique \u00e0 la lumi\u00e8re de ses nombreuses identit\u00e9s et valeurs qui se disputent la premi\u00e8re place : loyaut\u00e9, taghenanisme, f\u00e9minit\u00e9, \u2026et drarisme.\n\nDans un contexte o\u00f9 le monde lui susurre qu\u2019il faut choisir qui devenir, elle n\u2019y voit plus clair.\nSon papa, un personnage touchant, s\u2019implique dans l\u2019\u00e9ducation de sa petite fille en lui offrant ce qu\u2019il conna\u00eet de mieux, pensant que ses outils suffiront \u00e0 la prot\u00e9ger, car la plus grande hantise de son p\u00e8re est de ne pas pouvoir prot\u00e9ger son enfant du monde des adultes.\nSa m\u00e8re quant \u00e0 elle, depuis sa propre histoire tente de laisser cette petite fille devenir, mais la voir devenir c\u2019est aussi ne plus \u00eatre indispensable dans la vie de sa fille.\n\n\nCe spectacle est un t\u00e9moignage sinc\u00e8re de questionnements qui habitent une jeune femme en route vers elle-m\u00eame.\n\n\nAFTER SCENE\nJe 29.09 apr\u00e8s la repr\u00e9sentation. Avec Yousra Dahry.\nMod\u00e9ratrice Cathy Min Jung.\n\n\n\nACCOMPAGNEMENT SCOLAIRE GRATUIT\nAnimation pr\u00e9paratoire en classe (50\u2019), du 12 au 29 septembre.\n\nAvec Annabelle Giudice, m\u00e9diatrice du Rideau.\n\n\nTexte Yousra Dahry - Mise en sc\u00e8ne et dramaturgie Mohamed Ouachen - Avec Yousra Dahry - Assistante dramaturgie et production Samira Hmouda - Regard dramaturgique Bwanga Pilipili - Cr\u00e9ation lumi\u00e8re Tarek Lamrabti - R\u00e9gie g\u00e9n\u00e9rale Valentine Bibot - R\u00e9gie lumi\u00e8re Gauthier Minne ou Valentine Bibot - Photo visuel Roman Laschov.\n\nCoproduction Le Rideau, Citylab, Pianofabriek. Avec le soutien de la VGC et de Mestizo Arts Platform\/WIPCOOP. Production d\u00e9l\u00e9gu\u00e9e \/diffusion Le Rideau.","oEmbed_thumbnail_url":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/1505197195-a4bc9952de626c4675f611827c7658e3876df90ac24d47b01b8ac6fe485d06b6-d_640","oEmbed_thumbnail_width":640,"oEmbed_thumbnail_height":360,"oEmbed_thumbnail_url_with_play_button":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/filter\/overlay?src0=https%3A%2F%2Fi.vimeocdn.com%2Fvideo%2F1505197195-a4bc9952de626c4675f611827c7658e3876df90ac24d47b01b8ac6fe485d06b6-d_640&src1=http%3A%2F%2Ff.vimeocdn.com%2Fp%2Fimages%2Fcrawler_play.png","oEmbed_upload_date":"2022-09-11 04:15:30","oEmbed_video_id":748448561,"oEmbed_uri":"\/videos\/748448561","translations":{"fr":{"title":"KHEIR INCH'ALLAH : LE TEASER !"},"nl":{"title":"KHEIR INCH'ALLAH : LE TEASER !"},"en":{"title":"KHEIR INCH'ALLAH : LE TEASER !"},"de":{"title":"KHEIR INCH'ALLAH : LE TEASER !"},"it":{"title":"KHEIR INCH'ALLAH : LE TEASER !"},"sp":{"title":"KHEIR INCH'ALLAH : LE TEASER !"},"pt":{"title":"KHEIR INCH'ALLAH : LE TEASER !"},"cn":{"title":"KHEIR INCH'ALLAH : LE TEASER !"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-03-09","doors":"19:45:00","start":"20:00:00","end":"21:05:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-03-10","doors":"13:15:00","start":"13:30:00","end":"14:35:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-03-10","doors":"19:45:00","start":"20:00:00","end":"21:05:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":4},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"},"de":{"name":"Article 27"},"it":{"name":"Article 27"},"sp":{"name":"Article 27"},"pt":{"name":"Article 27"},"cn":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[551870],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-17T05:36:44+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-14T17:11:28+01:00","backoffice_id":271684,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.7937005259841},{"id":550949,"date_start":"2023-03-09","date_end":"2023-03-18","date_next":"2023-03-09","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[24,32],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Design"],"nl":["Galeries","Design"],"en":["Art Galleries","Design"],"de":["Kunstgalerien","Design"],"it":["Gallerie d'arte","Design"],"sp":["Galer\u00edas de arte","Dise\u00f1o"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"The gift to be Simple","shortdescr":"Wallonie-Bruxelles Design Mode pr\u00e9sente le travail de 9 designers textiles belges. Con\u00e7ue pour \u00eatre pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e \u00e0 la 7\u00e8me \u00e9dition du festival New York Textile Month en octobre 2022, l\u2019exposition s\u2019installe \u00e0 Bruxelles en marge du salon Collectible.","longdescr":"Con\u00e7ue par Lidewij Edelkoort et Philip Fimmano, l'exposition The Gift to be Simple explore la puret\u00e9 du design textile belge et sa corr\u00e9lation avec une esth\u00e9tique plus sobre aujourd'hui : d\u00e9couvrir l'excellence dans les objets du quotidien. \r\nEn tant que prescriptrice de tendances, Li Edelkoort observe l'\u00e9mergence que \"dans les p\u00e9riodes chaotiques et effrayantes, l'humanit\u00e9 cherche naturellement des r\u00e9ponses et trouve du r\u00e9confort dans la simplicit\u00e9. Les gens essaient de rendre l'ordinaire extraordinaire\". De plus, comme de nombreuses personnes se sont d\u00e9plac\u00e9es vers des r\u00e9gions rurales pendant la pand\u00e9mie, une approche plus authentique a \u00e9galement un impact sur les int\u00e9rieurs, la mode et le style de vie.","performers":"Natalia Brilli, Emma Cogn\u00e9, Design for resilience \u2013 Vanessa Colignon, Laure Kasiers, Charlotte Lancelot, Genevi\u00e8ve Levivier, Pascale Risbourg, Tenue de Ville \u2013 Alexia De Ville, C\u00e9line Vahsen.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wbdm.be\/fr\/agenda\/belgium-is-design-the-gift-to-be-simple\/","email":"info@wbdm.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550949"},"nl":{"name":"The gift to be Simple","shortdescr":"Wallonie-Bruxelles Design Mode presenteert het werk van 9 Belgische textielontwerpsters. De tentoonstelling werd opgezet voor de 7e editie van de New York Textile Month in oktober 2022 en is in Brussel te zien in het kader van Collectible, de beurs voor hedendaags design.","longdescr":"Wallonie-Bruxelles Design Mode presenteert het werk van 9 Belgische textielontwerpsters. De tentoonstelling werd opgezet voor de 7e editie van de New York Textile Month in oktober 2022 en is in Brussel te zien in het kader van Collectible, de beurs voor hedendaags design.","performers":"Natalia Brilli, Emma Cogn\u00e9, Design for resilience \u2013 Vanessa Colignon, Laure Kasiers, Charlotte Lancelot, Genevi\u00e8ve Levivier, Pascale Risbourg, Tenue de Ville \u2013 Alexia De Ville, C\u00e9line Vahsen.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wbdm.be\/fr\/agenda\/belgium-is-design-the-gift-to-be-simple\/","email":"info@wbdm.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550949"},"en":{"name":"The gift to be Simple","shortdescr":"Wallonie-Bruxelles Design Mode presents the work of 9 Belgian textile designers. Created to be presented at the 7th edition of the New York Textile Month festival in October 2022, the exhibition is set up in Brussels on the occasion of the Collectible design fair.","longdescr":"Curated by Lidewij Edelkoort and Philip Fimmano, The Gift to be Simple explores the purity of Belgian textile design and its correlation with a more sober aesthetic today: discovering excellence in everyday objects. \r\nAs a trendsetter, Li Edelkoort observes the emergence that \"in chaotic and frightening times, humanity naturally seeks answers and finds comfort in simplicity. People try to make the ordinary extraordinary.\" Moreover, as many people have moved to rural areas during the pandemic, a more authentic approach is also having an impact on interiors, fashion and lifestyle.","performers":"Natalia Brilli, Emma Cogn\u00e9, Design for resilience \u2013 Vanessa Colignon, Laure Kasiers, Charlotte Lancelot, Genevi\u00e8ve Levivier, Pascale Risbourg, Tenue de Ville \u2013 Alexia De Ville, C\u00e9line Vahsen.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wbdm.be\/fr\/agenda\/belgium-is-design-the-gift-to-be-simple\/","email":"info@wbdm.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550949"},"de":{"name":"The gift to be Simple","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wbdm.be\/fr\/agenda\/belgium-is-design-the-gift-to-be-simple\/","email":"info@wbdm.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550949"},"it":{"name":"The gift to be Simple","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wbdm.be\/fr\/agenda\/belgium-is-design-the-gift-to-be-simple\/","email":"info@wbdm.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550949"},"sp":{"name":"The gift to be Simple","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wbdm.be\/fr\/agenda\/belgium-is-design-the-gift-to-be-simple\/","email":"info@wbdm.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550949"},"pt":{"name":"The gift to be Simple","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wbdm.be\/fr\/agenda\/belgium-is-design-the-gift-to-be-simple\/","email":"info@wbdm.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550949"},"cn":{"name":"The gift to be Simple","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wbdm.be\/fr\/agenda\/belgium-is-design-the-gift-to-be-simple\/","email":"info@wbdm.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550949"}},"place":{"id":274596,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Atelier Jespers","address_street_name":"Avenue du Prince H\u00e9ritier","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"jf@atelierjespers.com","website":"https:\/\/www.atelierjespers.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 64 95 81","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","address_line1":"Avenue du Prince H\u00e9ritier","address_line2":"1200 Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","description_web":"L\u2019Atelier Jespers a accueilli des grands noms du design tels que Domeau & Peres, Michael Anastasiades ou encore le duo d\u2019architecte Berger & Berger. Dans le cadre de Design september et d\u2019Art Brussels, \u00e9v\u00e8nements majeurs de la sc\u00e8ne culturelle belge, l\u2019Atelier a \u00e0 c\u0153ur de proposer des expositions \u00e9xigeantes et nourissantes pour les visiteurs. Il a ainsi su s\u2019imposer comme lieu incontournable des programmations artistiques bruxelloises. L\u2019\u00e9crin de la maison moderniste cr\u00e9e en 1928 par Victor Bourgeois, membre du CIAM et premier professeur de l\u2019atelier d\u2019arcitecture de La Cambre, donne \u00e0 l\u2019Atelier Jespers, l\u2019ancrage historique et esth\u00e9tique dont les expositions ont besoin pour rendre les exceptionnelles. L\u2019ambiguit\u00e9 voulue de la maison\/atelier stimule parfaitement les d\u00e9sirs des cr\u00e9ateurs et conf\u00e8re aux \u00e9v\u00e8nements organis\u00e9s \u00e0 l\u2019Atelier Jespers \u00e0 la fois un c\u00f4t\u00e9 intime dans un cadre publique.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Atelier Jespers","address_street_name":"Erfprinslaan","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"jf@atelierjespers.com","website":"https:\/\/www.atelierjespers.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 64 95 81","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Sint-Lambrechts-Woluwe","address_line1":"Erfprinslaan","address_line2":"1200 Sint-Lambrechts-Woluwe","description_web":"Kunstenaarsatelier, architectenwoning en galerie: Atelier Jespers ligt op het kruispunt van verschillende werelden. De voormalige woning van de beeldhouwer Oscar Jespers, aan wie de galerie haar naam dankt, werd ontworpen door architect Victor Bourgeois. De minimalistische lijnen van het modernistisch ontwerp bieden het perfecte kader voor de tentoonstelling van hedendaagse kunst en design.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Atelier Jespers","address_street_name":"Avenue du Prince H\u00e9ritier","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"jf@atelierjespers.com","website":"https:\/\/www.atelierjespers.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 64 95 81","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","address_line1":"Avenue du Prince H\u00e9ritier","address_line2":"1200 Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","description_web":"Somewhere between an artist's studio, an architect's house and a gallery, Atelier Jespers lies at the crossroads of these worlds. Formerly the home of sculptor Oscar Jespers, to whom the gallery owes its name, its minimalist lines are the work of architect Victor Bourgeois.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Atelier Jespers","address_street_name":"Avenue du Prince H\u00e9ritier","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"jf@atelierjespers.com","website":"https:\/\/www.atelierjespers.com","phone_contact":"+32