tle":"FBIA - Match d'impro - Championnat 22-23 : Laconiques Anonymes VS Motus","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"FBIA - Match d'impro - Championnat 22-23 : Laconiques Anonymes VS Motus","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-03-10","doors":"20:00:00","start":"20:30:00","end":"23:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":12},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Jeunes"},"nl":{"name":"Jongeren"},"en":{"name":"Young people"},"de":{"name":"Jugendliche"},"it":{"name":"Ragazzi"},"sp":{"name":"J\u00f3venes"},"pt":{"name":"Jeunes"},"cn":{"name":"Jeunes"}},"value":6},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"},"de":{"name":"Article 27"},"it":{"name":"Article 27"},"sp":{"name":"Article 27"},"pt":{"name":"Article 27"},"cn":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-18T07:36:28+01:00","published_at":"2022-09-16T16:07:09+02:00","backoffice_id":262095,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":550426,"date_start":"2023-03-10","date_end":"2023-03-10","date_next":"2023-03-10","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert","it":"Concerti","sp":"Concierto","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"de":["Pop, Rock, Jazz...","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"it":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk e Country"],"sp":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, folk y country"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Driss El Maloumi (Maroc)","shortdescr":"Qualifi\u00e9 de \u00ab magicien du oud \u00bb et vant\u00e9 par la presse pour la qualit\u00e9, la puret\u00e9 et la d\u00e9licatesse de sa musique, Driss El Maloumi est n\u00e9 \u00e0 Agadir, au Maroc, en 1970. Avec \u00ab Aswat \u00bb (\u00ab Les sons \u00bb), il nous pr\u00e9sente sa nouvelle \u0153uvre musicale. Explorant musicalement les dimensions qui nous habitent quotidiennement, El Maloumi nous livre un r\u00eave qu\u2019il porte en lui depuis de nombreuses ann\u00e9es.","longdescr":"Qualifi\u00e9 de \u00ab magicien du oud \u00bb et vant\u00e9 par la presse pour la qualit\u00e9, la puret\u00e9 et la d\u00e9licatesse de son jeu et de sa musique, Driss El Maloumi est n\u00e9 \u00e0 Agadir, au Maroc, en 1970. Licenci\u00e9 en litt\u00e9rature arabe, il a une solide formation musicale classique arabe et occidentale. Largement reconnu sur le plan international, il a obtenu de nombreux prix dont le Prix d\u2019Honneur \u00e0 l\u2019Examen National de Oud du Conservatoire National de Musique de Rabat en 1994. Partant \u00e0 la rencontre de nombreuses traditions musicales, il a collabor\u00e9 avec des musiciens renomm\u00e9s tels que le maestro espagnol Jordi Savall, le griot malien Ballak\u00e9 Sissoko ou encore le musicien malgache Rajery. Il s\u2019est \u00e9galement produit avec plusieurs ensembles dont le Nederlands Blazers Ensemble (Pays-Bas), a jou\u00e9 avec des po\u00e8tes tels que Abdellatif La\u00e2bi (Maroc) & Adonis (Syrie) et a compos\u00e9 des musiques de films et spectacles.\r\n\r\nAvec \u00ab Aswat \u00bb (\u00ab Les sons \u00bb), il nous pr\u00e9sente sa nouvelle \u0153uvre musicale pour oud et percussions. Explorant musicalement les dimensions qui nous habitent quotidiennement, El Maloumi nous livre un r\u00eave qu\u2019il porte en lui depuis de nombreuses ann\u00e9es et qui r\u00e9sulte de sa qu\u00eate fondamentale de \u00ab l\u2019extase musicale \u00bb. Sa musique, d\u2019une clart\u00e9 myst\u00e9rieuse, s\u2019infiltre en nous tant\u00f4t doucement, tant\u00f4t brusquement, jusque dans le battement de nos c\u0153urs. Balan\u00e7ant entre d\u00e9licieuse tension et d\u00e9couverte permanente de la joie du temps et du r\u00eave, sa musique c\u00e9l\u00e8bre la m\u00e9ditation et la gloire de la beaut\u00e9.","performers":"Driss El Maloumi","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550426"},"nl":{"name":"Driss El Maloumi (Maroc)","shortdescr":"Hij wordt in de pers bejubeld als \u2018tovenaar van de oud\u2019 omwille van de kwaliteit, zuiverheid en verfijning in zijn spel en zijn muziek. Wij zijn dan ook bijzonder trots dat Driss El Maloumi zijn nieuwe album \u2018Aswat\u2019 (\u2018de klanken\u2019) voor en oud en percussie komt voorstellen.","longdescr":"Hij wordt in de pers bejubeld als \u2018tovenaar van de oud\u2019 omwille van de kwaliteit, zuiverheid en verfijning in zijn spel en zijn muziek. Wij zijn dan ook bijzonder trots dat Driss El Maloumi zijn nieuwe album \u2018Aswat\u2019 (\u2018de klanken\u2019) voor en oud en percussie komt voorstellen.\r\nDriss El Maloumi (Agadir, 1970) heeft naast een master in Arabische literatuur ook een uitgebreide vorming in zowel klassiek Arabische als Westers muziek. Hij ontving de ereprijs op het Nationaal Examen voor Oud van het Nationaal Muziekconservatorium van Rabat in 1994. El Maloumi wordt geprezen voor zijn internationale samenwerkingen met de Spanjaard Jordi Savall of met de Malinese griot Ballake Sissokio en de malagasy muzikant Rajery in het trio 3Ma. Hij trad ook op met wereldberoemde dichters als Abdellatif La\u00e2bi (Marokko) & Adonis (Syri\u00eb) en componeerde voor tal van films en voorstellingen.\r\n\r\nOp Aswat gaat hij op zoek naar de \u201cmuzikale extase\u201d, vertegenwoordigd door de tarab: het gelukzalige gevoel dat ontstaat tussen de artiest en het publiek. Hij laat zich inspireren door het dagelijkse leven: momenten van stilte, mysterie, eenvoud, kwetsbaarheid, kracht, schoonheid,\u2026 Op die manier cre\u00ebert hij een heerlijke spanning, een blijvende ontdekking van de vreugde van tijd en dromen. Als de noten zijn muziekinstrument verlaten, gaan we over tot meditatie en puur muzikaal genot.","performers":"Driss El Maloumi","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550426"},"en":{"name":"Driss El Maloumi (Maroc)","shortdescr":"Qualified as an \"oud magician\" and praised by the press for the quality, purity and delicacy of his playing and his music, Driss El Maloumi was born in Agadir, Morocco, in 1970. With \"Aswat\" (\"The sounds\"), he presents his new musical work for oud and percussion. Musically exploring the dimensions that inhabit us daily, El Maloumi gives us a dream that he has carried with him for many years.","longdescr":"Qualified as an \"oud magician\" and praised by the press for the quality, purity and delicacy of his playing and his music, Driss El Maloumi was born in Agadir, Morocco, in 1970. With a degree in Arabic literature, he has a solid Arabic and Western classical musical training. Widely recognized internationally, he has won numerous prizes including the Honor Prize at the National Oud Examination of the National Conservatory of Music in Rabat in 1994. Going to meet many musical traditions, he has collaborated with renowned musicians such as the Spanish maestro Jordi Savall, the Malian griot Ballak\u00e9 Sissoko or the Malagasy musician Rajery. He has also performed with several ensembles including the Nederlands Blazers Ensemble (Netherlands), has played with poets such as Abdellatif La\u00e2bi (Morocco) & Adonis (Syria) and has composed music for films and shows.\r\n\r\nWith \"Aswat\" (\"The sounds\"), he presents his new musical work for oud and percussion. Musically exploring the dimensions that inhabit us daily, El Maloumi gives us a dream that he has carried with him for many years and which results from his fundamental quest for \u201cmusical ecstasy\u201d. His music, with a mysterious clarity, infiltrates us sometimes gently, sometimes abruptly, even in the beating of our hearts. Swinging between delicious tension and permanent discovery of the joy of time and dreams, his music celebrates meditation and the glory of beauty.","performers":"Driss El Maloumi","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550426"},"de":{"name":"Driss El Maloumi (Maroc)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550426"},"it":{"name":"Driss El Maloumi (Maroc)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550426"},"sp":{"name":"Driss El Maloumi (Maroc)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550426"},"pt":{"name":"Driss El Maloumi (Maroc)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550426"},"cn":{"name":"Driss El Maloumi (Maroc)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550426"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique, keeps music and dance traditions alive and kicking in Brussels through an ambitious programme of concerts, courses, and projects. A year-round concert programme, featuring Belgian and international artists, forms the core of the foundation\u2019s activities. From the contemplative to the madly fest