n":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,48],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Architecture"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Architectuur"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Architecture "],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Architektur"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Architettura"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Arquitectura"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Ce qu'habiter veut dire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"L\u2019exposition Ce qu\u2019habiter veut dire, organis\u00e9e par l\u2019ICA au MAD Brussels, retrace le parcours de trois ann\u00e9es d\u2019actions culturelles \u00e0 la rencontre du territoire belge francophone et de ses habitant.e.s. Durant cette exploration, en utilisant le levier que repr\u00e9sente la culture, nous ouvrions une question \u00e0 l\u2019ensemble de nos publics: \u201cPour vous, c\u2019est quoi habiter?\u201d\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\nCar habiter ce n\u2019est pas seulement se loger, c\u2019est aussi prendre conscience d\u2019un paysage et d\u2019un territoire, c\u2019est r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir \u00e0 faire avec ce qui existe d\u00e9j\u00e0, ce qui est d\u00e9j\u00e0 b\u00e2ti et am\u00e9nag\u00e9, c\u2019est participer \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9laboration de son cadre de vie et \u00e0 la culture qui s\u2019anime autour, c\u2019est enfin et avant tout r\u00eaver d\u2019un cadre de vie autre, porteur de mieux-\u00eatre.\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\nInstallations, maquettes, fresques, t\u00e9moignages, vid\u00e9os, photographies, croquis et collages illustrent dans cette exposition la diversit\u00e9 des approches de celles et ceux qui pensent notre cadre de vie. Cette production \u00e9mane de rencontres entre habitants, architectes, photographes, urbanistes, paysagistes et artistes et fait na\u00eetre ainsi de nouveaux horizons. Elle offre \u00e0 voir des visions riches tant\u00f4t construites, tant\u00f4t esquiss\u00e9es, tant\u00f4t ancr\u00e9es dans le r\u00e9el, tant\u00f4t utopiques. Chaque sujet de ce floril\u00e8ge est d\u00e9licatement compos\u00e9, c\u2019est-\u00e0-dire mis en sc\u00e8ne, afin de faire parler l\u2019architecture et d\u2019inspirer chaque visiteur.teuse sur ce th\u00e8me.\r\n\r\nUne vingtaine de projets d\u2019architecture contemporaine marquants en Wallonie et \u00e0 Bruxelles de ces trente derni\u00e8res ann\u00e9es, est \u00e9galement montr\u00e9e sous la forme de maquettes, coupes, et documents graphiques. Alli\u00e9e \u00e0 une s\u00e9rie de photographies, l\u2019ensemble compose une interpr\u00e9tation sensible de l\u2019environnement b\u00e2ti et non-b\u00e2ti actuel de la Belgique francophone.\r\n\r\nL'exposition Ce qu\u2019habiter veut dire est \u00e9galement l\u2019occasion pour l\u2019ICA de publier un ouvrage \u00e9ponyme qui compl\u00e8te le contenu de l\u2019exposition. Il apporte d\u2019autres r\u00e9ponses d\u2019experts \u00e0 cette question, ainsi que les r\u00e9ponses de celles et ceux qui habitent en Belgique francophone. Une mani\u00e8re de prolonger l\u2019exp\u00e9rience de l\u2019exposition et d\u2019emporter avec soi un souvenir des oeuvres expos\u00e9es.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550029"},"nl":{"name":"Ce qu'habiter veut dire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"De tentoonstelling Ce qu'habiter veut dire, georganiseerd door het ICA in MAD Brussels, weerspiegelt drie jaar aan culturele acties om het Franstalige Belgische grondgebied en zijn inwoners te ontmoeten. Tijdens deze verkenning, met cultuur als hefboom, stelden we een vraag aan al het publiek: \"Wat betekent wonen voor u?\u2028\u2028\"\r\n\r\nWant wonen is niet alleen wonen, het is ook bewust zijn van een landschap en een gebied, het is nadenken over wat te doen met wat al bestaat, wat al gebouwd en ontwikkeld is, het is deelnemen aan de uitwerking van een eigen woonomgeving en aan de cultuur die eromheen bloeit, het is tenslotte en vooral dromen van een woonomgeving, een die bevorderlijk is voor een beter welzijn.\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\nInstallaties, maquettes, fresco's, getuigenissen, video's, foto's, schetsen en collages illustreren in deze tentoonstelling de uiteenlopende benaderingen van degenen die nadenken over onze leefomgeving. Het is het resultaat van ontmoetingen tussen bewoners, architecten, fotografen, stedenbouwkundigen, landschapsontwerpers en kunstenaars en opent zo nieuwe perspectieven. Het biedt rijke visies, soms geconstrueerd, soms geschetst, soms verankerd in de werkelijkheid, soms utopisch. Elk onderwerp in deze bloemlezing is delicaat gecomponeerd en ge\u00ebnsceneerd, om de architectuur voor zichzelf te laten spreken en elke bezoeker over dit thema te inspireren.\r\n\r\nEen twintigtal opmerkelijke hedendaagse architectuurprojecten in Walloni\u00eb en Brussel van de laatste dertig jaar worden getoond in de vorm van maquettes, plannen en grafische documenten. In combinatie met een reeks foto's vormt het ensemble een gevoelige interpretatie van de huidige bebouwde en onbebouwde omgeving van Belgi\u00eb.\r\n\r\nDe tentoonstelling Ce qu'habiter veut dire is ook de aanleiding voor het ICA om een gelijknamig boek uit te geven dat de inhoud van de tentoonstelling aanvult. Een manier om de ervaring van de tentoonstelling uit te breiden en een souvenir van de tentoongestelde werken mee naar huis te nemen.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550029"},"en":{"name":"Ce qu'habiter veut dire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"The exhibition Ce qu'habiter veut dire, organized by the ICA at MAD Brussels, retraces the path of three years of cultural actions to meet the French-speaking Belgian territory and its inhabitants. During this exploration, with culture as leverage, we opened a question to all audiences: \"For you, what is inhabiting?\u2028\u2028\"\r\n\r\nBecause living is not only housing, it is also becoming aware of a landscape and a territory, it is thinking about what to do with what already exists, what is already built and developed, it is participating in the development of its living environment and the culture that is animated around it, it is finally and above all dreaming of a different living environment, bringing better well-being.\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\nInstallations, models, frescoes, testimonies, videos, photographs, sketches and collages illustrate in this exhibition the diversity of approaches of those who rethink our living environment. This exhibition is the result of encounters between residents, architects, photographers, urban planners, landscape designers and artists, thus opening up new horizons. It provides rich visions, sometimes constructed, sometimes sketched, sometimes grounded in reality, sometimes utopian. Each subject of this exhibition is delicately composed and staged, in order to make architecture speak and to inspire each visitor on this theme.\r\n\r\nAbout twenty contemporary architecture projects that have been outstanding in Wallonia and Brussels over the last thirty years are shown in the form of models, ground plans and graphic documents. Allied to a series of photographs, the whole composes a sensitive interpretation of the current built and non-built environment of French-speaking Belgium.\r\n\r\nThe exhibition Ce qu'habiter veut dire is also the occasion for the ICA to publish an eponymous book that completes the content of the exhibition. A way to extend the experience of the exhibition and to take with you a souvenir of the works exhibited.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550029"},"de":{"name":"Ce qu'habiter veut dire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550029"},"it":{"name":"Ce qu'habiter veut dire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550029"},"sp":{"name":"Ce qu'habiter veut dire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550029"},"pt":{"name":"Ce qu'habiter veut dire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550029"},"cn":{"name":"Ce qu'habiter veut dire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550029"}},"place":{"id":250516,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"],"de":["Zentrum"],"it":["Centro"],"sp":["Centro"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12629,"location":{"lat":50.85116098,"lon":4.34417688},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-02-17T10:05:04+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:34:31+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":250516,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en 