l,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"de":["Pop, Rock, Jazz...","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"it":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk e Country"],"sp":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, folk y country"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"The night of the voices - Hella (Belgique), Rodjenice (Serbie)","shortdescr":"Cette soir\u00e9e sera consacr\u00e9e au chant a cappella.\r\nHella est un ensemble folk a cappella compos\u00e9 des chanteuses Eline De Coninck, Kalinka Verschraegen, Lotte Pauwels et Ahanna Verschraegen, qui interpr\u00e8te des compositions et arrangements traditionnels hollandais. Le groupe serbe Rodjenice r\u00e9unit trois chanteuses qui se sont connues lors de leurs \u00e9tudes en ethnomusicologie.","longdescr":"Hella est un ensemble folk a cappella compos\u00e9 des chanteuses Eline De Coninck, Kalinka Verschraegen, Lotte Pauwels et Ahanna Verschraegen, qui interpr\u00e8te des compositions et arrangements traditionnels hollandais. A la recherche d\u2019une harmonie homog\u00e8ne et unique, Hella  s\u2019inspire des sonorit\u00e9s scandinaves et de la musique chorale. Laissez-vous envo\u00fbter par ces quatre voix f\u00e9minines qui vous livrent des m\u00e9lodies claires, chaudes et color\u00e9es.\r\n\r\nLe groupe serbe Rodjenice, du nom du trio de d\u00e9esses qui d\u00e9cidait du sort des nouveau-n\u00e9s, r\u00e9unit trois chanteuses qui se sont connues lors de leurs \u00e9tudes en ethnomusicologie. Avec ce trio, elles mettent en pratique leurs recherches et insufflent un vent nouveau au chant traditionnel de l\u2019ex-Yougoslavie via diff\u00e9rentes techniques vocales. Le r\u00e9pertoire du groupe, bas\u00e9 presqu\u2019exclusivement sur des chansons de petites villes rurales de cette r\u00e9gion, est interpr\u00e9t\u00e9 avec une grande authenticit\u00e9 vocale. Se produisant avec d\u2019autres groupes et artistes, les chanteuses associent musique traditionnelle et performances musicales plus contemporaines et exp\u00e9rimentales.","performers":"Hella:\r\nEline De Coninck : chant\r\nKalinka Verschraegen : chant\r\nLotte Pauwels : chant\r\nAhanna Verschraegen : chant\r\n\r\nRodjenice:\r\nMirjana Rai\u0107 Tepi\u0107 : chant, tambourin\r\nKatarina Petri\u0107 : chant, tambourin\r\nKatarina Nikoli\u0107 : chant, tambourin","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550427"},"nl":{"name":"The night of the voices - Hella (Belgique), Rodjenice (Serbie)","shortdescr":"Deze avond staat volledig in het teken van a capella zang.\r\nHella is een a capella folk ensemble rond zangeressen Eline De Coninck, Kalinka Verschraegen, Lotte Pauwels en Ahanna Verschraegen. De Servische groep Rodjenice, vernoemd naar het trio godinnen dat het lot van de pasgeborenen zou bepalen, verenigt drie zangeressen die elkaar ontmoetten tijdens hun studie etnomusicologie.","longdescr":"Hella is een a capella folk ensemble rond zangeressen Eline De Coninck, Kalinka Verschraegen, Lotte Pauwels en Ahanna Verschraegen. Ze brengen Nederlandstalige composities en arrangementen van traditionele melodie\u00ebn. Hella zoekt naar een unieke homogene samenklank en laat zich hierbij inspireren door Scandinavische klanken en koormuziek. Laat je betoveren door vier vrouwenstemmen die je meenemen naar heldere, warme en kleurrijke harmonie\u00ebn.\r\n\r\nDe Servische groep Rodjenice, vernoemd naar het trio godinnen dat het lot van de pasgeborenen zou bepalen, verenigt drie zangeressen die elkaar ontmoetten tijdens hun studie etnomusicologie. Met het trio brachten ze hun onderzoek in de praktijk. Ze gingen op zoek naar de verschillende vocale technieken in de traditionele zang in het voormalige Joegoslavi\u00eb en bliezen die nieuw leven in. Het repertoire van de groep is bijna uitsluitend gebaseerd op liederen uit landelijke en kleinere steden in het gebied van voormalig Joegoslavi\u00eb, die met de grootst mogelijke vocale authenticiteit worden uitgevoerd. Als gevolg daarvan traden ze ook op met andere groepen en artiesten, waarbij ze de confrontatie aangingen tussen traditionele muziek met hedendaagse en experimentele muziekuitvoeringen.","performers":"Hella:\r\nEline De Coninck: zang\r\nKalinka Verschraegen: zang\r\nLotte Pauwels: zang\r\nAhanna Verschraegen: zang\r\n\r\nRodjenice:\r\nMirjana Rai\u0107 Tepi\u0107: zang, tamboerijn\r\nKatarina Petri\u0107: zang, tamboerijn\r\nKatarina Nikoli\u0107: zang, tamboerijn","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550427"},"en":{"name":"The night of the voices - Hella (Belgique), Rodjenice (Serbie)","shortdescr":"Hella is an a cappella folk ensemble composed of singers Eline De Coninck, Kalinka Verschraegen, Lotte Pauwels and Ahanna Verschraegen, which performs traditional Dutch compositions and arrangements. The Serbian group Rodjenice, named after the trio of goddesses who decided the fate of newborns, brings together three singers who met during their studies in ethnomusicology.","longdescr":"Hella is an a cappella folk ensemble composed of singers Eline De Coninck, Kalinka Verschraegen, Lotte Pauwels and Ahanna Verschraegen, which performs traditional Dutch compositions and arrangements. In search of a homogeneous and unique harmony, Hella is inspired by Scandinavian sounds and choral music. Let yourself be enchanted by these four female voices who deliver clear, warm and colorful melodies.\r\n\r\nThe Serbian group Rodjenice, named after the trio of goddesses who decided the fate of newborns, brings together three singers who met during their studies in ethnomusicology. With this trio, they put their research into practice and breathe new life into the traditional song of former Yugoslavia through different vocal techniques. The group's repertoire, based almost exclusively on songs from small rural towns in this region, is interpreted with great vocal authenticity. Performing with other groups and artists, the singers combine traditional music with more contemporary and experimental musical performances","performers":"Hella:\r\nEline De Coninck : singing\r\nKalinka Verschraegen : singing\r\nLotte Pauwels : singing\r\nAhanna Verschraegen : chant\r\n\r\nRodjenice:\r\nMirjana Rai\u0107 Tepi\u0107 : singing, tambourine\r\nKatarina Petri\u0107 : singing, tambourine\r\nKatarina Nikoli\u0107 : singing, tambourine","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550427"},"de":{"name":"The night of the voices - Hella (Belgique), Rodjenice (Serbie)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550427"},"it":{"name":"The night of the voices - Hella (Belgique), Rodjenice (Serbie)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550427"},"sp":{"name":"The night of the voices - Hella (Belgique), Rodjenice (Serbie)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550427"},"pt":{"name":"The night of the voices - Hella (Belgique), Rodjenice (Serbie)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550427"},"cn":{"name":"The night of the voices - Hella (Belgique), Rodjenice (Serbie)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550427"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique, keeps music and dance traditions alive and kicking in Brussels through an ambitious programme of concerts, courses, and projects. A year-round concert programme, featuring Belgian and international artists, forms the core of the foundation\u2019s activities. From the contemplative to the madly festive concerts take place indoors,  in the small Moli\u00e8re Theatre, in the arcade at the Porte de Namur and outdoors, around the city and throughout the year.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","websi