0e9es et v\u00e9cus du groupe. Le livre arpent\u00e9 lors de ces sessions est \u201cKing Kong th\u00e9orie\" de Virginie Despentes.\r\n\r\nLes \u00e9v\u00e8nements auront lieu \u00e0 l\u2018Espace Car\u00eame 1-7 rue du Chapelain, 1070 Anderlecht.\r\n\r\nParticipation gratuite mais r\u00e9servation indispensable \u00e0 l\u2019accueil de l\u2019Espace Car\u00eame durant les heures d\u2019ouverture T\u00e9l 02\/526.83.30-40. Ou par mail emca.reservations@anderlecht.brussels\r\n\r\nA l\u2019initiative de Fabrice Cumps, Bourgmestre et Echevin de la culture, \u00e0 l\u2019initiative de J\u00e9r\u00e9mie Drouart, \u00c9chevin de l\u2019\u00c9galit\u00e9 des Chances et avec le soutien duColl\u00e8ge Echevinal d\u2019Anderlecht, de la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles \u2014Direction G\u00e9n\u00e9rale de la Culture- Service G\u00e9n\u00e9ral des Lettres et du Livre et de la\r\nCommission Communautaire Fran\u00e7aise de la R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale. E.R. : Marcel Vermeulen","performers":"Ligue des familles","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.emca.be\/noustoutes","email":"emca.reservations@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552734"},"nl":{"name":"Atelier d\u2019arpentage f\u00e9ministe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.emca.be\/noustoutes","email":"emca.reservations@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 40","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 40","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552734"},"en":{"name":"Atelier d\u2019arpentage f\u00e9ministe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.emca.be\/noustoutes","email":"emca.reservations@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels