By Jonathan Loys\r\n\u25baTenue de soir\u00e9e est souhait\u00e9e","longdescr":"International Party at L'Imperial Premium Bar - Powered by Just A Night\r\n\u203c Exclusive Location\u203c\r\n01# JUST A NIGHT goes to l'Imperial\r\n\u25ba L\u2019entr\u00e9e est gratuite avant 22:30\r\n\u25ba En Avant soir\u00e9e : Burlesque\r\n\u25ba La soir\u00e9e By Just A Night\r\n\u25ba Music By Jonathan Loys\r\n\u25baTenue de soir\u00e9e est souhait\u00e9e\r\n\r\nDans une recherche constante de nouveaut\u00e9s, la Just A Night est le concept le plus itin\u00e9rant de la capitale, un concept informel fond\u00e9 par des amoureux de la nuit qui font bouger la nuit bruxelloise depuis plus de 10 ans... Avec un public cosmopolite on y croise des artistes belges et internationaux, des leaders d'opinion, des fous, les meilleurs DJ'S, des mannequins, des flambeurs, des pirates, des promoteurs de soir\u00e9es, des hommes d'affaires, les expats de Bxl ou tout simplement les anonymes...\r\n\r\nVenez d\u00e9couvrir ce petit bijoux qui nous ouvre ses portes.","performers":"Imperial premium Bar vs Just A Night Label","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1337690273675007\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 478 58 60 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552934"},"nl":{"name":"Just An Imperial Night \u2022 International Party","shortdescr":"Internationaal feest in L'Imperial Premium Bar - Mogelijk gemaakt door Just A Night\r\n\u203cExclusieve verhuur\u203c\r\n01# JUST A NIGHT gaat naar de Imperial\r\n\u25ba De toegang is gratis tot 22.30 uur.\r\n\u25ba Voor de avond: Burlesque\r\n\u25ba De avond Door Just A Night\r\n\u25ba Muziek door Jonathan Loys\r\n\u25baAvondkleding is gewenst","longdescr":"Internationaal feest in L'Imperial Premium Bar - Mogelijk gemaakt door Just A Night\r\n\u203cExclusieve verhuur\u203c\r\n01# JUST A NIGHT gaat naar de Imperial\r\n\u25ba De toegang is gratis tot 22.30 uur.\r\n\u25ba Voor de avond: Burlesque\r\n\u25ba De avond Door Just A Night\r\n\u25ba Muziek door Jonathan Loys\r\n\u25baAvondkleding is gewenst\r\n\r\nIn een constante zoektocht naar nieuwigheden is Just A Night het meest rondreizende concept van de hoofdstad, een informeel concept opgericht door liefhebbers van de nacht die al meer dan 10 jaar het Brusselse nachtleven opschudden... Met een kosmopolitisch publiek ontmoet Belgische en internationale artiesten, opinieleiders, gekken, de beste dj's, modellen, gokkers, piraten, partypromotors, zakenlieden, expats uit Brussel of gewoon anonieme mensen ...\r\n\r\nKom en ontdek dit juweeltje dat zijn deuren voor ons opent.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1337690273675007\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 478 58 60 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552934"},"en":{"name":"Just An Imperial Night \u2022 International Party","shortdescr":"\u25ba Two floors, three ambiences (Classic cocktails \u2013 Cosy Lounge - Champagnoth\u00e8que & Premium Spirits in the vip Room)\r\n\u25baGuests are advised to reserve a table at the bar in advance \/\r\n+32 478586039 \/\/ info@justanight.net","longdescr":"THIS SAT. 11.03.2023 \/ Bxl Main Event\r\nJust An Imperial Night \u2022 International Party | Imperial x Just A Night\r\n\u25ba \u25ba https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/2I9qyL4bI\r\nPowered by Just A Night, Euro Village\r\nMusic by Olivier Gosseries\r\n-----------------\r\nFree Entrance before 22:30\r\nJUST A NIGHT Label goes to l'Imp\u00e9rial\r\nDIFFERENT ATMOSPHERES & ROOMS \r\n\u25ba Two floors, three ambiences (Classic cocktails \u2013 Cosy Lounge - Champagnoth\u00e8que & Premium Spirits in the vip Room)\r\n\u25baGuests are advised to reserve a table at the bar in advance \/\r\n+32 478586039 \/\/ info@justanight.net\r\n\u25ba Doors Open : 21:00\r\n\u25ba DRESS TO IMPRESS \/ URBAN CHIC\r\n-----------------\r\nCOME DANCE\r\nMINGLE WITH GREAT PEOPLE\r\nJOIN US\r\nBRING FRIENDS\r\nARRIVE EARLY\r\nSPREAD THE WORD\r\nINVITE FRIENDS\r\nEVERYONE IS WELCOME\r\n==========\r\nNew Live Music Experience\r\nLet the party continue !\r\nThe Just A Night Team\r\n==========\r\nIMP\u00c9RIAL PRIVATE PREMIUM BAR BRUSSELS\r\n67 Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 1000 Brussels (Adjacent Courthouse)","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1337690273675007\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 478 58 60 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552934"},"de":{"name":"Just An Imperial Night \u2022 International Party","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1337690273675007\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 478 58 60 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552934"},"it":{"name":"Just An Imperial Night \u2022 International Party","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1337690273675007\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 478 58 60 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552934"},"sp":{"name":"Just An Imperial Night \u2022 International Party","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1337690273675007\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 478 58 60 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552934"},"pt":{"name":"Just An Imperial Night \u2022 International Party","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1337690273675007\/","email":"info@justa