genda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551554"},"pt":{"name":"Post-Partum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-aventure.be","email":"info@cinema-aventure.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551554"},"cn":{"name":"Post-Partum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-aventure.be","email":"info@cinema-aventure.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551554"}},"place":{"id":247874,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Aventure","address_street_name":"Galerie du Centre","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-aventure.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-aventure.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 92 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie du Centre, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Cach\u00e9 au d\u00e9tour des rues anim\u00e9es du centre-ville l\u2019Aventure est situ\u00e9 \u00e0 quelques encablures de la Place de la Monnaie. Il voue ses \u00e9crans \u00e0 une programmation \u00e9clectique o\u00f9 films grand public et films d\u2019auteurs cohabitent en bonne intelligence. On raconte d\u2019ailleurs que le roi Baudoin, grand cin\u00e9phile, aimait le fr\u00e9quenter ! On s\u2019y rend pour l\u2019offre \u00ab documentaire \u00bb particuli\u00e8rement bien \u00e9toff\u00e9e, mais aussi pour voir et revoir des films plusieurs mois apr\u00e8s qu\u2019ils aient disparu de l\u2019affiche des grands cin\u00e9s.\r\n\r\nEnti\u00e8rement r\u00e9nov\u00e9 d\u00e9but 2010, ce petit cin\u00e9ma habill\u00e9 de velours propose une ambiance cosy soulign\u00e9e par des ambiance tamis\u00e9es. Suffisamment rare pour \u00eatre mentionn\u00e9, le bar permet de boire un verre en attendant sa s\u00e9ance et m\u00eame de siroter sa boisson dans la salle !","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cinema Aventure","address_street_name":"Centrumgalerij","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-aventure.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-aventure.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 92 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Centrumgalerij, 57","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Verstopt om de hoek van de drukke straten van het stadscentrum ligt de Aventure, op een steenworp van het Muntplein. De bioscoopzaal biedt een eclectisch programma aan waarin mainstream- en auteursfilms elkaar perfect aanvullen. Het verhaal doet trouwens de ronde dat koning Boudewijn, een groot filmliefhebber, deze bioscoop graag bezocht! Je gaat erheen voor het bijzonder goed samengestelde documentaireaanbod, maar ook om films te (her)bekijken die al enkele maanden uit de grote bioscopen verdwenen zijn.\r\n\r\nDeze kleine, in fluweel gehulde bioscoop is begin 2010 volledig gerenoveerd en baadt dankzij de gedimde verlichting in een gezellige sfeer. Zeldzaam genoeg om te vermelden: je kunt in de bar iets drinken terwijl je op de voorstelling wacht, en in de zaal kun je verder aan je drankje nippen!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Aventure","address_street_name":"Galerie du Centre","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-aventure.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-aventure.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 92 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Galerie du Centre, 57","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Hidden away down the bustling streets of the city centre, the Aventure is just a short walk from Place de la Monnaie. It devotes its screens to an eclectic programme where mainstream and auteur films live in harmony. It is said that King Baudouin, a great lover of film, liked to frequent it! People go to the Aventure for its rich documentary programme, but also to watch and rewatch films months after they have disappeared from the billboards of big cinemas.\r\n\r\nFully renovated in early 2010, this small cinema dressed in velvet offers a cosy atmosphere underlined by subdued surroundings. The bar lets you have a drink while waiting for your screening or even sip your drink while watching your film - rare enough to merit a mention!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Aventure","address_street_name":"Galerie du Centre","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-aventure.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-aventure.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 92 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie du Centre, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das am 30. Oktober 1953 mit \"The Man in Between\" eingeweihte Cinema Aventure wurde an der Stelle des ehemaligen Coliseum-Kinos (1920-1948) errichtet. Es hei\u00dft, dass der \u00fcberaus cinephile K\u00f6nig Baudoin, ein regelm\u00e4\u00dfiger Gast war...\r\nDas Adventure wurde Anfang 2010 komplett renoviert und befindet sich im Herzen des historischen Stadtzentrums von Br\u00fcssel, in der N\u00e4he des Place de la Monnaie und des Grand-Place.\r\nDas Kino bietet ein vielseitiges Programm an Autorenfilmen, anderen sorgf\u00e4ltig ausgew\u00e4hlten Filmperlen (besonders auch f\u00fcr die Kleinsten) und Dokumentarfilmen - ein Genre, das dem Cinema Aventure besonders am Herzen liegt. Das Kino hei\u00dft zudem eine Reihe von Festivals willkommen (Millenium Festival, Mittelmeer-Festival, Pink Screen Festival, ...) und pflegt verschiedene Partnerschaften (SACD-SCAM, GDAC, Cin\u00e9 Club des Libert\u00e9s, ..).\r\nAlle S\u00e4le sind mit weichen und ger\u00e4umigen Kinosesseln ausgestattet. Atmosph\u00e4re, Klang und Hightech-Bilder (2 Kinos\u00e4le sind mit 3D ausgestattet) sorgen f\u00fcr ein vollendetes Kino-Erlebnis.\r\nDas Kino begr\u00fc\u00dft Verliebte im wahrsten Sinne des Wortes \"mit offenen Armen\": Die so genannten \"Love Seats\", deren Duositze nicht durch Armlehnen getrennt sind, befinden sich in der letzten Reihe.\r\nDas Cinema Aventure versteht sich als VIP-Kino, das f\u00fcr jedermann offen ist. Was Sie hier nicht finden sind Popcorn und Nachos, doch Ihr Glas Wein oder Bier d\u00fcrfen Sie in den Kinos\u00e4len gerne genie\u00dfen.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Aventure","address_street_name":"Galerie du Centre","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-aventure.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-aventure.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 92 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie du Centre, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Aventure","address_street_name":"Galerie du Centre","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-aventure.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-aventure.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 92 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie du Centre, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Aventure","address_street_name":"Galerie du Centre","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cinema-aventure.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-aventure.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 92 02","p