u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte du patrimoine de l'UNESCO, de Magritte, de l'art d\u00e9co, du chocolat et bien plus encore. Explore.Brussels organise \u00e9galement des festivals bruxellois et d'autres projets de grande envergure.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Brugmannlaan","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Ukkel","address_line1":"Brugmannlaan, 405","address_line2":"1180 Ukkel","description_web":"Explore.Brussels is een netwerk van verenigingen voor geleide bezoeken in Brussel. Deze organisatie omvat ARAU, Arkadia, Bruxelles Bavard, Pro Velo, La Fonderie en Korei. De evenementen worden georganiseerd in coproductie met deze 6 bedrijven. Individuele of groepstochten zijn mogelijk te voet, per fiets, per bus en per boot.  Bezoekers ontdekken UNESCO erfgoed, Magritte, art deco, chocolade en nog veel meer. Explore.Brussels organiseert ook Brusselse festivals en andere grootschalige projecten.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Explore.Brussels is a network of guided tour associations in Brussels. This organisation includes ARAU, Arkadia, Bruxelles Bavard, Pro Velo, La Fonderie and Korei. Events are organised in co-production with these 6 companies. Individual or group tours are available on foot, by bike, by bus and by boat.  Visitors discover UNESCO heritage, Magritte, art deco, chocolate and much more. Explore.Brussels also organises Brussels festivals and other large-scale projects.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Explore.Brussels ist ein Zusammenschluss von Vereinen, die qualitativ hochwertige Stadtf\u00fchrungen in der Region Br\u00fcssel-Hauptstadt organisieren.\r\nDie Mitgliedsvereine sind ARAU, Pro Velo, Brussels Chatterguides und Arkadia. Im Jahr 2020 hat sich La Fonderie als Partnerverein angeschlossen.\r\nEntdecken Sie das UNESCO-Weltkulturerbe, Jugendstilarchitektur, die Bauwerke von Victoria Horta, Gem\u00e4lde von Magritte, Comic-Kunst von Herg\u00e9, Streetart, Europa, Bier, Schokolade oder besichtigen Sie architektonische Perlen des Jugendstils, des Art-d\u00e9co oder des Neoklassizismus, die normalerweise nicht f\u00fcr die \u00d6ffentlichkeit zug\u00e4nglich sind. Die F\u00fchrungen werden sowohl f\u00fcr Einzelbesucher als auch f\u00fcr Gruppen angeboten und reichen von klassischen \u00fcber originelle bis hin zu vollkommen neuen Konzepten und Formaten. Neben Stadtf\u00fchrungen zu Fu\u00df sind auch Besichtigungen per Fahrrad, Bus oder Boot m\u00f6glich.\r\nExplore.Brussels organisiert unter anderem auch das Jugendstil- und Art-d\u00e9co-Festival BANAD, die Brussels Biennale - Neoclassic (BBN) sowie weitere Projekte, darunter die Ausbildung von Stadtf\u00fchrern, der \u201eVerein der Freunde\u201c und der \u201eVerein der Eigent\u00fcmer\u201c. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Explore.brussels","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":27246,"location":{"lat":50.80795462,"lon":4.34397082},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-03-03T04:35:08+01:00","published_at":"2017-02-27T10:05:49+01:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[],"dates":[{"day":"2023-03-16","doors":null,"start":"18:30:00","end":"20:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":5},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"},"de":{"name":"Article 27"},"it":{"name":"Article 27"},"sp":{"name":"Article 27"},"pt":{"name":"Article 27"},"cn":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_profile":{"list":[322],"translations":{"fr":["Art Nouveau & Art D\u00e9co"],"nl":["Art nouveau & art deco"],"en":["Art Nouveau &  Art D\u00e9co"],"de":["Jugendstil & Art d\u00e9co"],"it":["Art Nouveau e Art D\u00e9co"],"sp":["Art nouveau y art d\u00e9co"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"tags":["annee_art_nouveau"],"is_part_of":"Ann\u00e9e Art Nouveau","accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-03-03T04:35:08+01:00","published_at":"2023-03-03T03:30:20+01:00","backoffice_id":272776,"import_origin":"explore","sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":549799,"date_start":"2023-03-16","date_end":"2023-03-17","date_next":"2023-03-16","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":70,"translations":{"fr":"Foire & salon","nl":"Beurzen & salons","en":"Fairs and shows","de":"Messe & Ausstellung","it":"Fiere ed esposizioni","sp":"Feria y exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Science is Wonderful!","shortdescr":"Le salon scientifique Science is Wonderful! aura lieu \u00e0 Bruxelles les 16 et 17 mars 2023 \u00e0 la Maison de la Poste, \u00e0 Bruxelles.\r\nCette \u00e9dition comprendra des exp\u00e9riences pratiques interactives \u00e9poustouflantes, des jeux, et bien plus encore, r\u00e9alis\u00e9s par 100 chercheurs venus de toute l'Europe. La participation est gratuite, inscrivez-vous d\u00e8s maintenant avec votre classe.","longdescr":"Science is Wonderful ! fait le lien entre la recherche et les \u00e9coles \u00e0 travers l'Union europ\u00e9enne. Ce salon c\u00e9l\u00e8bre la valeur et l'impact de la recherche en donnant aux \u00e9l\u00e8ves du primaire et du secondaire la possibilit\u00e9 d'interagir avec des chercheurs et des innovateurs, d'en apprendre davantage sur leur travail dans des formats engageants et de poser des questions sur les carri\u00e8res scientifiques. Depuis sa cr\u00e9ation en 2015, Science is Wonderful ! organise chaque ann\u00e9e une foire scientifique qui pr\u00e9sente de mani\u00e8re interactive des projets de recherche et des innovations par le biais de pr\u00e9sentations, d'exp\u00e9riences pratiques, de jeux et de quiz.\r\n\r\nLa foire scientifique Science is Wonderful ! de 2023 aura lieu \u00e0 Bruxelles les 16 et 17 mars 2023 \u00e0 la Maison de la Poste, \u00e0 Bruxelles.\r\nCette \u00e9dition comprendra des exp\u00e9riences pratiques interactives \u00e9poustouflantes, des jeux et bien plus encore, r\u00e9alis\u00e9s par 100 chercheurs venus de toute l'Europe. La participation est gratuite, inscrivez-vous d\u00e8s maintenant avec votre classe.\r\n\r\nQue vous ayez une classe d'\u00e9cole, un enfant ou que vous soyez simplement curieux, rejoignez-nous pour cette c\u00e9l\u00e9bration de la science. Vous \u00eates int\u00e9ress\u00e9 ? Alors inscrivez-vous \u00e0 notre newsletter pour rester inform\u00e9 et \u00eatre l'un des premiers \u00e0 en savoir plus sur l'\u00e9v\u00e9nement.\r\n\r\nInformations cl\u00e9s \r\n- Date : 16-17 mars 2023\r\n- Lieu : Maison de la Poste, Rue Picard 5\/7, Bruxelles\r\n- L'\u00e9v\u00e9nement est gratuit, inscription obligatoire pour les \u00e9coles. Aucune inscription n'est requise pour les particuliers et les petits groupes.\r\n- Le d\u00e9jeuner et le transport gratuit en bus jusqu'au lieu de l'\u00e9v\u00e9nement peuvent \u00eatre organis\u00e9s sur demande (disponibilit\u00e9 limit\u00e9e).\r\n\r\nN'h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 contacter info-siw@vo-europe.eu si vous avez des questions.","performers":"Le salon scientifique Science is Wonderful! pr\u00e9sentera plus de 40 projets mettant en avant les meilleures recherches europ\u00e9ennes par le biais d'exp\u00e9riences \u00e9poustouflantes, de jeux, d'ateliers et de nombreuses autres activit\u00e9s destin\u00e9es aux \u00e9l\u00e8ves et \u00e0 toute personne int\u00e9ress\u00e9e par la science.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scienceiswonderful.eu\/en","email":"info-SIW@vo-europe.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549799"},"nl":{"name":"Science is Wonderful!","shortdescr":"De wetenschapsbeurs Science is Wonderful! vindt plaats op 16 & 17 maart 2023 in het Maison de la Poste in Brussel.\r\nDeze editie omvat interactieve presentaties, praktische experimenten, spelletjes en meer, uitgevoerd door 100 onderzoekers uit heel Europa. Deelname is gratis, schrijf je nu in met je klas.","longdescr":"De Science is Wonderful! wetenschapsbeurs slaat een brug tussen dit onderzoek en scholen in de hele Europese Unie. Het viert de waarde en de impact van door de EU gefinancierd onderzoek door leerlingen in het basis- en middelbaar onderwijs de kans te geven contact op te nemen met toonaangevende onderzoekers en innovators, meer te weten te komen over hun werk in interactieve formaten en vragen te stellen over wetenschappelijke loopbanen. Sinds de oprichting in 2015 organiseerd Science is Wonderful! een jaarlijkse wetenschapsbeurs die onderzoeksprojecten en innovaties interactief tentoonstelt door middel van presentaties, hands-on experimenten, spelletjes en quizzen.\r\n\r\nDe volgende editie vindt plaats op 16 & 17 maart 2023 in het Maison de la Poste in Brussel en nodigt 100 onderzoekers uit heel Europa uit.\r\nDeze editie bevat interactieve presentaties, hands-on experimenten, spellen en quizzen. Deelname staat open voor iedereen \u2013 gezinnen, schoolklassen, fans van de wetenschap \u2013 en is gratis. Registreer nu met uw klas.\r\n\r\nOf je nu een schoolklas hebt, een kind hebt of gewoon jong van hart bent, kom langs en vier de wetenschap met ons. Ge\u00efnteresseerd? Meld u dan aan voor onze nieuwsbrief om op de hoogte te blijven en wees \u00e9\u00e9n van de eersten te zijn die meer weten over het evenement.\r\n\r\nBelangrijke informatie\r\n- Datum: 16 & 17 maart 2023\r\n- Locatie: Maison de la Poste, Picardstraat 5\/7, Brussel\r\n- Het evenement is gratis, registratie is vereist voor schoolklassen of groten groepen. Kleine groepen of individuen hoeven zich niet te registreren\r\n- Lunch en gratis busvervoer naar de locatie kunnen voor schoolklassen op verzoek worden geregeld (beperkte beschikbaarheid)\r\n\r\nNeem gerust contact op met info-siw@vo-europe.eu als u vragen heeft.","performers":"Op de wetenschapsbeurs Science is Wonderful! worden meer dan 40 projecten gepresenteerd waarin het beste Europese onderzoek wordt getoond aan de hand van verbluffende experimenten, spelletjes, workshops en vele andere activiteiten voor scholieren en iedereen die belangstelling heeft voor wetenschap.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scienceiswonderful.eu\/fr","email":"info-SIW@vo-europe.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549799"},"en":{"name":"Science is Wonderful!","shortdescr":"The Science is Wonderful! science fair will take place in Brussels on 16 and 17 March 2023 at the Maison de la Poste, Brussels.\r\nThis edition will include interactive mind-blowing hands-on experiments, games, and more performed by 100 researchers from across Europe. Participation is free of charge, register now with your class.","longdescr":"Science is Wonderful! bridges research with schools across the European Union. It celebrates the value and impact of research by giving primary and secondary school students the chance to interact with leading researchers and innovators, learn more about their work in engaging formats and ask questions about scientific careers. Since its inception in 2015, Science is Wonderful! has organised an annual science fair that interactively showcases research projects and innovations through presentations, hands-on experiments, games and quizzes.\r\n\r\nThe 2023 Science is Wonderful! science fair will take place in Brussels on 16 and 17 March 2023 at the Maison de la Poste, Brussels.\r\nThis edition will include interactive mind-blowing hands-on experiments, games, and more performed by 100 researchers from across Europe. Participation is free of charge, register now with your class.\r\n\r\nWhether you have a school class, a child or are simply young at heart, join us for this celebration of science. Interested? Then sign up to our newsletter to stay informed and be one of the first to know more about the event.\r\n\r\nKey information \r\n- Date: 16-17 March 2023\r\n- Location: Maison de la Poste, Rue Picard 5\/7, Brussels\r\n- The event is free of charge, registration required for schools. No registration needed for individuals and small groups.\r\n- Lunch and free bus transport to the venue can be arranged upon request (limited availability).\r\n\r\nPlease feel free to contact info-siw@vo-europe.eu if you have any questions.","performers":"The Science is Wonderful! science fair will feature over 40 projects showcasing the best European research through mind-blowing experiments, games, workshops and many other activities for school pupils and anyone interested in science.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scienceiswonderful.eu\/nl","email":"info-SIW@vo-europe.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549799"},"de":{"name":"Science is Wonderful!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scienceiswonderful.eu\/en","email":"info-SIW@vo-europe.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549799"},"it":{"name":"Science is Wonderful!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scienceiswonderful.eu\/en","email":"info-SIW@vo-europe.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549799"},"sp":{"name":"Science is Wonderful!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scienceiswonderful.eu\/en","email":"info-SIW@vo-europe.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549799"},"pt":{"name":"Science is Wonderful!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scienceiswonderful.eu\/en","email":"info-SIW@vo-europe.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549799"},"cn":{"name":"Science is Wonderful!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scienceiswonderful.eu\/en","email":"info-SIW@vo-europe.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_ur