de lundi jusqu'\u00e0 vendredi, 09:30-17:00\r\nFerm\u00e9 pendant le weekend et les jours f\u00e9riers.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 06 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552127"},"nl":{"name":"The invisible world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Het denkbeeldige was er altijd al, sinds het begin der tijden. Geijkt in elk levend wezen, geschreven in het hart van elk kind. Het potentieel zit in ons, de kracht van de gedachte, de capaciteit om uit het niets een veelheid van alles te genereren. Geloof daarom altijd in jezelf, heb vertrouwen in je kunnen, twijfel niet tot in het oneindige... jij bent het. \u2013 Jabien Lionthiel\r\n\r\n\r\nVernissage: donderdag 16.03.2023 van 18:00 tot 21:00\r\nExpo loopt van 16.03.2023 tot 17.04.2023\r\nVrije toegang, open van ma tot vrij 09:30-17:00\r\nGesloten in het weekend en op feestdagen.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 06 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552127"},"en":{"name":"Le monde invisible","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 06 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552127"},"de":{"name":"The invisible world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 06 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552127"},"it":{"name":"The invisible world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnem