"Concert","de":"Konzert","it":"Concerti","sp":"Concierto","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[4,7],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"de":["Pop, Rock, Jazz...","Pop, Rock"],"it":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"sp":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, rock"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Fleuves Noirs (FR) + SECTE (BE) + POZI (UK)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Fleuves Noirs pics by Titouan Mass\u00e9\r\n***Fleuves Noirs (FR) Post Punk Transe***\r\nLa musique de Fleuves Noirs est organique et puissante quand elle parle au corps, maniaque et\r\nincantatoire quand elle s\u2019adresse \u00e0 l\u2019esprit. Elle est\r\nmen\u00e9e par un cerveau malade voyageant \u00e0 bord d\u2019une enveloppe athl\u00e9tique. Le corps de\r\nFleuves Noirs c\u2019est le duo basse-batterie, deux jumeaux \u00e9lev\u00e9s \u00e0 la pulsation martel\u00e9e\r\nqui chaussent du 46. L\u2019esprit c\u2019est le chant et la guitare, jou\u00e9s par un punk-arty atteint de\r\ntroubles dissociatifs de l\u2019identit\u00e9 et par un pianiste r\u00e9p\u00e9tant ses classiques de minimale\r\nau bouzouki.\r\nhttps:\/\/fleuvesnoirs.bandcamp.com\/album\/respecte-toi\r\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=osUHYaYEUOE\r\n--- --- ---\r\n\r\n***POZI (UK) Post Punk Discordance***\r\nSigned to Prah, Pozi come steeped in the lineage of the very best weirdo British indie pop. The trio of drummer\/vocalist Toby Burroughs, violinist\/vocalist Rosa Brook and bassist\/vocalist Tom Jones have a skittish, restless energy.\u2028In addition to gambling addiction and debt, lyrical subjects range from the Grenfell Tower tragedy to Chinese human rights transgressions to Brexit to smartphone addition, corrupt police, relationship jealousy and poor mental health provision, each are unpacked vividly.\r\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/...\/UCbRy1KjSIWrotkikksH83VA\/videos\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/open.spotify.com\/artist\/0i1dJNVY6kGU5lUzmwXNhS...\r\nhttps:\/\/poziband.bandcamp.com\/\r\n\r\n--- --- ---\r\n***SECTE (BE) Hard Folk***\r\nSince 2018, Gregory Duby, guitar (K-Branding, Jesus is My Son, Solah) and David.C, drums (Vitas\r\nGuerulaitis, Tat2noisact) have been inventing their own sect.\r\nThey've been in the noise scene for years and are based in cosmopolitan Brussels. They imagine\r\noriental dunes on which Dick Dale flirts with Munir Bashir, ramble in a desert with a Turkish\r\npriesthood fed by the Doors, or the invocation of an ancient icon from Vilvoorde with a Syrian\r\nslide.\r\nhttps:\/\/sectebxl.bandcamp.com\/\r\n--- --- ---\r\nA partir de 20h \/\/ 9 Euros (Nobody gets turned away for lack of funds)\r\n\u2028Please bring CASH!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"superconcertbxl@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551252"},"nl":{"name":"Fleuves Noirs (FR) + SECTE (BE) + POZI (UK)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"superconcertbxl@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551252"},"en":{"name":"Fleuves Noirs (FR) + SECTE (BE) + POZI (UK)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"superconcertbxl@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551252"},"de":{"name":"Fleuves Noirs (FR) + TBA @ Super Fourchette","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"superconcertbxl@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551252"},"it":{"name":"Fleuves Noirs (FR) + 