ltat d\u2019une alchimie unique entre d\u00e9racinement et ancrage. Les m\u00e9lodies poignantes et oniriques alternent avec des compositions rythm\u00e9es \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9nergie soutenue. Chaque musicien nourrit l\u2019ensemble de son jeu habile, donnant un son original o\u00f9 s'entrem\u00ealent la subtilit\u00e9 particuli\u00e8re du koto japonais avec les m\u00e9lodies enjou\u00e9es de la kora ouest-africaine, le piano et la contrebasse, la fl\u00fbte et le setar iranien, les percussions et les voix. \r\nIls joueront ici en quintet:\r\nOsvaldo Hernandez \/\/ percussions\r\nSimon Leleux \/\/ doholla\r\nC\u00e9lestin Massot \/\/ piano\r\nBao Sissoko \/\/ kora\r\nLydie Thonnard \/\/ flutes et voix","performers":"Osvaldo Hernandez \/\/ percussions\r\nSimon Leleux \/\/ doholla\r\nC\u00e9lestin Massot \/\/ piano\r\nBao Sissoko \/\/ kora\r\nLydie Thonnard \/\/ flutes et voix","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552890"},"nl":{"name":"Wide-Open Session #1 - Auster Loo Collective","shortdescr":"Auster Loo Collective verenigt muzikanten uit Belgi\u00eb, Japan, Iran, Mexico en Senegal en werkte samen met muzikanten als Damon Albarn (Gorillaz, Blur), Zap Mama, Deep Forest en Ibrahim Maalouf.","longdescr":"Met dit nieuwe project gaan ze de uitdaging aan om hun achtergronden in dienst te stellen van een nieuwe muzikale taal. Er ontstaat een uniek universum, het resultaat van een unieke alchemie tussen ontworteling en verankering. De aangrijpende en dromerige melodie\u00ebn wisselen af met ritmische composities van aanhoudende energie. Elke muzikant voedt het geheel met zijn eigen vaardige spel, waardoor een origineel geluid ontstaat waarin de bijzondere subtiliteit van de Japanse koto zich verweeft met de speelse melodie\u00ebn van de West-Afrikaanse kora, de piano en de contrabas, de fluit en de Iraanse setar, de percussies en de stemmen. \r\nZij spelen hier als kwintet:\r\nOsvaldo Hernandez \/\/ percussie\r\nSimon Leleux \/\/ doholla\r\nC\u00e9lestin Massot \/\/ piano\r\nBao Sissoko \/\/ kora\r\nLydie Thonnard \/\/ fluiten en stem","performers":"Osvaldo Hernandez \/\/ percussions\r\nSimon Leleux \/\/ doholla\r\nC\u00e9lestin Massot \/\/ piano\r\nBao Sissoko \/\/ kora\r\nLydie Thonnard \/\/ flutes et voix","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552890"},"en":{"name":"Wide-Open Session #1 - Auster Loo Collective","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552890"},"de":{"name":"Wide-Open Session #1 - Auster Loo Collective","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552890"},"it":{"name":"Wide-Open Session #1 - Auster Loo Collective","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552890"},"sp":{"name":"Wide-Open Session #1 - Auster Loo Collective","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552890"},"pt":{"name":"Wide-Open Session #1 - Auster Loo Collective","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552890"},"cn":{"name":"Wide-Open Session #1 - Auster Loo Collective","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552890"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un lieu atypique et chaleureux dans le quartier de Tour & Taxis \u00e0 Bruxelles pour assister \u00e0 des concerts, des expositions, des projections ou des conf\u00e9rences, ou pour y organiser vos \u00e9v\u00e8nements priv\u00e9s.\r\nUn projet d\u00e9di\u00e9 au \u00ab beau \u00bb sous toutes ses coutures, dont les maitres-mots sont qualit\u00e9, \u00e9changes et rencontres.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Picardstraat, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De naam \"Baixu\" betekent \"mooi\" in de taal van de Pataxos indianen die in de zuidelijke staat Bahia (Brazili\u00eb) wonen. Dit woord staat voor de ambitie van het project en de kwaliteit van de culturele evenementen, maar ook voor de verbondenheid van de initiatiefnemers met de Braziliaanse cultuur. \r\nLe Baixu is ondergebracht in een voormalig industrieel gebouw in het hart van de trendy Brusselse Tour & Taxis wijk. Een atypische en warme plek bedoeld voor concerten, tentoonstellingen, filmvertoningen en conferenties en waar je ook priv\u00e9 evenementen kan organiseren. Het is een volledig uitgeruste, multidisciplinaire culturele ruimte met een oppervlakte van 150 m2, gewijd aan de \"schoonheid\" in al haar vormen. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard,