nouvel an persan. Venez f\u00eater 1402 avec nous, une ann\u00e9e pleine de vie et d\u2019espoirs de changement !","longdescr":"AU PROGRAMME :\r\nDe 12h00 \u00e0 20h : PETIT MARCH\u00c9 PERSAN - Artisanat (bijoux, c\u00e9ramiques, v\u00eatement...) et cr\u00e9ations persanes avec Golobolbol Persian Webshop, les dessins de Azam, les photos et autres \u0153uvres de Sepideh et Mahsa, le th\u00e9, cocktails et p\u00e2tisseries d\u2019Iran.\r\nDe 12h00 \u00e0 21h : MANGER PERSAN - Plats afghans propos\u00e9s par Qais - Snack et cookies persans, cuisin\u00e9s par Roya (les fonds r\u00e9colt\u00e9s iront \u00e0 \u201cIranian CF Community\u201d, association qui soutient les enfants atteints de mucoviscidose en Iran) et les petits g\u00e2teaux Arezoo.\r\n14h30 \u00e0 16h : ATELIER \u00ab CALLIGRAPHIE PERSANE \u00bb (Atelier donn\u00e9 en fran\u00e7ais et anglais). Gratuit mais inscription conseill\u00e9e : commentpeutonetrepersan@gmail.com ou par t\u00e9l\u00e9phone : 0472\/ 59 11 00\r\n16h30 \u00e0 18h : ATELIER ENFANT (5 \u00e0 10 ans) \u00ab COLLAGES ET PEINTURES PERSANES \u00bb (Atelier donn\u00e9 en fran\u00e7ais et anglais), anim\u00e9 par Nooshyar Khalili. Gratuit mais inscription conseill\u00e9e : commentpeutonetrepersan@gmail.com ou par t\u00e9l\u00e9phone : 0472\/ 59 11 00\r\n20h \u00e0 22h : DJ SET sp\u00e9cial Norouz avec DJ Seb-Cat (Rebel-up) et Arian Zand : de la musique d\u2019hier et d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui de tous les pays qui f\u00eatent le nouvel an persan (Iran, Afghanistan, Kurdistan, Tadjikistan\u2026) pour s\u2019ambiancer et danser persan.","performers":"L'\u00e9quipe \"Comment peut-on \u00eatre persan?\"","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/141335705222582","email":"commentpeutonetrepersan@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 541 01 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552925"},"nl":{"name":"NOROUZ - Ontdek het Perzische Nieuwjaar!","shortdescr":"We zijn terug om het Perzische Nieuwjaar te vieren. Kom en vier 1402 met ons, een jaar vol leven en hoop op verandering!","longdescr":"Van 12:00 tot 20:00 uur: LITTLE PERSIAN MARKET - Handwerk (juwelen, keramiek, kleding...) en Perzische creaties met Golobolbol Persian Webshop, Azam's tekeningen, Sepideh en Mahsa's mixed media werken, Iraanse thee, cocktail en gebak.\r\n12.00 tot 21.00 uur: PERSAN EAT - Afghaanse gerechten door Qais en Perzische snacks en koekjes gekookt door Roya (die kookt om haar vereniging \"Iranian CF Community\" voor kinderen met Cystic Fibrosis te helpen), en tenslotte de desserts door Arezoo.\r\n14.30 tot 16.00 uur: WORKSHOP \"CALLIGRAPHY\" (Workshop gegeven in het Frans, Engels en eventueel Perzisch). Gratis maar inschrijving aanbevolen: commentpeutonetrepersan@gmail.com of per telefoon: 0472\/59 11 00\r\n16u30 tot 18u : WORKSHOP \" COLLAGE EN SCHILDEREN VOOR KINDEREN \" (Workshop gegeven in het Engels en Frans en eventueel Perzisch). Geanimeerd door Nooshyar Khalili. Gratis maar inschrijving aanbevolen: commentpeutonetrepersan@gmail.com of per telefoon: 0472\/ 59 11 00\r\n20u tot 22u: DJ SET special Norouz met DJ Seb-Cat (Rebel-up) en Arian Zand: muziek van gisteren en vandaag uit alle landen die het Perzisch Nieuwjaar vieren (Iran, Afghanistan, Koerdistan, Tadzjikistan ...) om te dansen en te genieten van het Perzisch.\r\n Het is in de Pianofabriek (35 Rue du Fort, 1060 Sint-Gillis) van 12:00 tot 22:00 uur.\r\nWelkom, Khosh\u00e2madid !\r\n Gratis toegang\r\nDit evenement wordt ondersteund door VGC en PianoFabriek.","performers":"Het \"Hoe kun je Perzisch zijn?\" team","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/141335705222582","email":"commentpeutonetrepersan@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 541 01 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552925"},"en":{"name":"NOROUZ - Discover the Persian New Year !","shortdescr":"We are back to celebrate the Persian New Year. Come and celebrate 1402 with us, a year full of life and hope to change!","longdescr":"From 12:00 to 08:00 pm: LITTLE PERSIAN MARKET - Crafts (jewelry, ceramics, clothing...) and Persian creations with Golobolbol Persian Webshop, Azam's drawings, Sepideh and Mahsa\u2019s mixed media works,Iranian tea,cocktail and pastries.\r\n12:00 pm to 9 pm: PERSAN EAT - Afghan dishes by Qais and Persian snacks and cookies cooked by Roya (who cooks to help her association \u201cIranian CF Community\u201d for children with Cystic Fibrosis), and finally the desserts by Arezoo.\r\n2:30pm to 4pm: WORKSHOP \"CALLIGRAPHY\" (Workshop given in French, English and possibly Persian). Free but registration recommended: commentpeutonetrepersan@gmail.com or by phone: 0472\/ 59 11 00\r\n4:30pm to 6pm : WORKSHOP \"COLLAGE AND PAINTING FOR CHILDREN \" (Workshop given in English and French and Persian if necessary). Animated by Nooshyar Khalili. Free but registration recommended: commentpeutonetrepersan@gmail.com or by phone: 0472\/ 59 11 00\r\n8pm to 10pm: DJ SET special Norouz with DJ Seb-Cat (Rebel-up) and Arian Zand: music of yesterday and today from all countries that celebrate the Persian New Year (Iran, Afghanistan, Kurdistan, Tajikistan ...) to dance and enjoy Persian.\r\n It will be at the Pianofabriek (35 Rue du Fort, 1060 Saint-Gilles) from 12:00 to 10:00pm.\r\nWelcome, Khosh\u00e2madid !\r\n Free entrance\r\nThis event is supported by VGC and PianoFabriek.","performers":"The team \"Comment peut-on \u00eatre persan?\"","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/141335705222582","email":"commentpeutonetrepersan@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 541 01 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552925"},"de":{"name":"NOROUZ - D\u00e9couvrez le nouvel an persan !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/141335705222582","email":"comm