oi les propri\u00e9t\u00e9s physiques et chimiques de l'eau ont-elles permis \u00e0 la vie de se d\u00e9velopper et de survivre sur Terre ? Comment la vie est-elle apparue ? Comment a-t-elle \u00e9volu\u00e9 ?\r\n\r\nNous en profitons pour visiter les zones humides du bois du Scheutbos : sources, ruisseaux, \u00e9tangs et roseli\u00e8res.\r\n\r\nMarche de 2h.\r\n\r\nR\u00e9servation par mail \u00e0 leveque.jean@hotmail.com ou par t\u00e9l\u00e9phone au 0496 530 768","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/environnement.brussels\/citoyen\/agenda\/campaign\/journees-bruxelloises-de-leau-2023","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 53 07 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552802"},"nl":{"name":"Waarom is water de bron van het leven?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/environnement.brussels\/citoyen\/agenda\/campaign\/journees-bruxelloises-de-leau-2023","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 53 07 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552802"},"en":{"name":"Pourquoi l'eau est-elle source de vie ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/environnement.brussels\/citoyen\/agenda\/campaign\/journees-bruxelloises-de-leau-2023","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 53 07 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552802"},"de":{"name":"Pourquoi l'eau est-elle source de vie ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/environnement.brussels\/citoyen\/agenda\/campaign\/journees-bruxelloises-de-leau-2023","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 53 07 68","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552802"},"it":{"name":"Pourquoi l'eau est-elle source de vie ?","shor