,"longdescr":"Ce week-end th\u00e9matique vous est propos\u00e9 pour vous immerger dans cette culture aux atours simples mais demandant de s\u2019y plonger pour comprendre son attrait : la construction d\u2019un rythme et d\u2019une m\u00e9lodie \u00e0 l\u2019unisson, faite pour emporter, dans la danse et en musique, les pieds des participant.es.\r\n\r\nLe week-end d\u00e9butera le vendredi par une immersion en Virginie Occidentale. Annick Odom vous initiera aux ballades de cet \u00c9tat, c\u00e9l\u00e8bre pour ces chansons traditionnelles transmises oralement au fil des g\u00e9n\u00e9rations. Elles parlent souvent d\u2019histoires et de culture locale et sont interpr\u00e9t\u00e9es le plus souvent sans accompagnement musical par des femmes. Annick Odom vous pr\u00e9sentera Phyllis Marks : une regrett\u00e9e chanteuse de ballade aupr\u00e8s de laquelle elle a appris en personne de nombreuses pi\u00e8ces du r\u00e9pertoire de la r\u00e9gion. Une occasion de d\u00e9couvrir les tr\u00e9sors de ce style multi-centenaire et de chanter soi-m\u00eame sa premi\u00e8re ballade.\r\n\r\nLa soir\u00e9e se poursuivra par la projection du documentaire Dance All Night \u2013 The Highwoods Stringband Story. Dans les ann\u00e9es 1970, ce groupe a convaincu des dizaines de milliers d\u2019auditeurs gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son g\u00e9nie musical, alliant humour, exub\u00e9rance et r\u00e9pertoire \u00e9clectique. Il a \u00e9t\u00e9 nomin\u00e9 aux Grammy Awards et a jou\u00e9 dans de grands festivals. Combinant s\u00e9quences de performances, photographies, enregistrements sonores et interviews, ce film color\u00e9 de Larry Edelman capture l\u2019esprit de l\u2019\u00e9poque et de ce groupe unique.\r\n\r\nL\u00e9o Divary pr\u00e9sentera enfin le Sacred Harp, style de musique chorale a capella qui a \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 aux \u00c9tats-Unis au XVIIIe si\u00e8cle. Il est consid\u00e9r\u00e9 comme l\u2019un des premiers styles de musique am\u00e9ricaine et est rest\u00e9 populaire jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce jour. Le Sacred Harp se caract\u00e9rise par des harmonies complexes et une m\u00e9thode unique de notation musicale qui utilise des formes g\u00e9om\u00e9triques pour repr\u00e9senter les notes de mani\u00e8re \u00e0 la rendre accessible \u00e0 tous et toutes. L\u00e9o Divary pr\u00e9sentera cette technique et donnera au public l\u2019occasion de s\u2019essayer lui-m\u00eame \u00e0 la chose : frissons garantis.\r\n\r\nLa soir\u00e9e se terminera par une s\u00e9ance de pratique du Sacred Harp dans le foyer, suivie d\u2019une jam session \u2018Old-Time\u2019.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nLe samedi, un concert des professeurs sera organis\u00e9 dans le foyer, suivi d\u2019un bal \u2018Old-Time\u2019 (square dance). Plus d\u2019infos sur la page du concert.\r\nDes stages seront propos\u00e9s pendant tout le week-end. Voir le programme complet sur la page des stages.","performers":"Annick Odom\r\nL\u00e9o Divary","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552238"},"nl":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","shortdescr":"Intro ballades West-Virginia, Docu, Intro Sacred Harp & Jam session\r\n\r\nLang voor de country en bluegrass op een moderne manier de wereld veroverden, deed de muziek van kleine gemeenschappen van boeren en vervolgens mijnwerkers in het oosten van de Verenigde Staten al dansen en dromen.","longdescr":"Deze rurale muziek kwam begin twintigste eeuw de ether binnen onder de naam Hillbilly Music en later \u201cold-time\u201d. De oorsprong is terug te vinden in de Europese en Afrikaanse folktradities van waaruit zich verschillende dansen en ballads en andere liedjes ontstonden. Sinds enkele jaren ontwikkelt zich in de Verenigde Staten en nu ook in West-Europa een nieuwe generatie van old time muzikanten. Ook in ons land is de stijl aan een revival toe en er ontstond een Belgische scene, met uitwisseling over de grenzen. Tijdens dit weekend kan je niet alleen alle knepen van de old time leren via stages gitaar, mandoline, zang, banjo, viool en square dance en flat foot, maar krijg je op vrijdag een prachtige documentaire over de legendarische old time revival-band, the Highwood Stringband, een initiatie in de vocale tradities, gevolgd door een sacred harp sessie.\r\n\r\nOp vrijdag word je ondergedompeld in de zangstijlen van de old time en krijg je met Dance All Night het verhaal te zien van een legendarische old time revival-band.\r\n\r\nIn de jaren zeventig enthousiasmeerde the Highwoods Stringband tienduizenden luisteraars voor traditionele old time met hun unieke mix van muzikale genialiteit, uitbundigheid, humor en een eclectisch repertoire. Dat leverde Grammy nominaties op. De band speelde op grote folkfestivals in de VS en toerde door Latijns-Amerika en Europa. Ze inspireerde ook talloze andere muzikanten en hun invloed op de muziek is nog steeds te horen. Deze kleurrijke film van Larry Edelman combineert zeldzame performancebeelden, foto\u2019s, geluidsopnamen en interviews en geeft treffend de tijdgeest en de vreugde en opwinding van de band weer.\r\n\r\nSacred Harp is een stijl van a capella koormuziek die in de 18de eeuw in de VS werd ontwikkeld. Het wordt beschouwd als een van de vroegste stijlen van Amerikaanse muziek en is tot op de dag van vandaag populair gebleven. Sacred Harp wordt gekenmerkt door complexe harmonie\u00ebn en een unieke methode van muzieknotatie die geometrische vormen gebruikt om noten weer te geven op een manier die het voor iedereen toegankelijk maakt. Leo Divary zal deze techniek presenteren en het publiek de kans geven om het zelf uit te proberen: spanning gegarandeerd.\r\n\r\nWe eindigen de avond met een Sacred Harp sessie in de foyer, gevolgd door een old time jam sessie.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOp zaterdag is er een lerarenconcert in de foyer, gevolgd door een old time bal.\r\nGedurende het hele weekend zullen er workshops plaatsvinden gerelateerd aan de American Roots muziek. Meer info over de workshops vind je hier.","performers":"Annick Odom\r\nL\u00e9o Divary","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552238"},"en":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","shortdescr":"Intro ballads West-Virginia, Docu, Intro Sacred Harp & Jam session\r\n\r\nCome discover and discuss \u201cold-time\u201d music, an American tradition whose lively practice has spread to Europe.","longdescr":"This themed weekend is proposed to you to immerse yourself in this culture with simple finery, but requiring you to immerse yourself in it to understand its appeal: the construction of a rhythm and a melody in unison, made to take away, in dance and music, the feet of the participants.\r\n\r\nThe weekend will begin on Friday with an immersion in West Virginia. Annick Odom will introduce you to the ballads of this state, famous for these traditional songs passed down orally over generations. They often talk about stories and local culture and are performed most often without musical accompaniment by women. Annick Odom will introduce you to Phyllis Marks: a late ballad singer from whom she learned in person many pieces from the region's repertoire. An opportunity to discover the treasures of this multi-centenary style and to sing your own first ballad.\r\n\r\nThe evening will continue with the screening of the documentary Dance All Night \u2013 The Highwoods Stringband Story. In the 1970s, this group won over tens of thousands of listeners with its musical genius, combining humor, exuberance and an eclectic repertoire. He was nominated for Grammy Awards and performed at major festivals. Combining performance footage, photographs, sound recordings and interviews, this colorful film by Larry Edelman captures the spirit of the times and of this unique band.\r\n\r\nL\u00e9o Divary will finally present the Sacred Harp, a style of a capella choral music that was developed in the United States in the 18th century. It is considered one of the earliest styles of American music and has remained popular to this day. The Sacred Harp is characterized by complex harmonies and a unique method of musical notation that uses geometric shapes to represent notes in a way that makes it accessible to everyone. L\u00e9o Divary will present this technique and give the public the opportunity to try it themselves: thrills guaranteed.\r\n\r\nThe evening will end with a Sacred Harp practice session in the foyer, followed by an \u2018Old-Time\u2019 jam session.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOn Saturday, a teachers' concert will be organized in the foyer, followed by an 'Old-Time' ball (square dance). More info on the concert page.\r\nWorkshops will be offered throughout the weekend. See the full program on the courses page.","performers":"Annick Odom\r\nL\u00e9o Divary","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552238"},"de":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552238"},"it":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552238"},"sp":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552238"},"pt":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552238"},"cn":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552238"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique, keeps music and dance traditions alive and kicking in Brussels through an ambitious programme of concerts, courses, and projects. A year-round concert programme, featuring Belgian and international artists, forms the core of the foundation\u2019s activities. From the contemplative to the madly festive concerts take place indoors,  in the small Moli\u00e8re Theatre, in the arcade at the Porte de Namur and outdoors, around the city and throughout the year.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_b