re des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique, keeps music and dance traditions alive and kicking in Brussels through an ambitious programme of concerts, courses, and projects. A year-round concert programme, featuring Belgian and international artists, forms the core of the foundation\u2019s activities. From the contemplative to the madly festive concerts take place indoors,  in the small Moli\u00e8re Theatre, in the arcade at the Porte de Namur and outdoors, around the city and throughout the year.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":1922,"location":{"lat":50.83785217,"lon":4.3630838},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-02-21T13:35:05+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:45+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/21ae97b5cac7d0e2a30840b77705a96d0c28fd5e.jpg","width":1024,"height":683,"ratio":1.5,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","copyright":"Freddy Kesio"},"nl":{"title":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","copyright":"Freddy Kesio"},"en":{"title":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","copyright":"Freddy Kesio"},"de":{"title":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","copyright":"Freddy Kesio"},"it":{"title":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","copyright":"Freddy Kesio"},"sp":{"title":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","copyright":"Freddy Kesio"},"pt":{"title":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","copyright":"Freddy Kesio"},"cn":{"title":"American Roots Weekend - Friday Night","copyright":"Freddy Kesio"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-03-24","doors":null,"start":"20:00:00","end":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":14},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Pr\u00e9vente"},"nl":{"name":"Voorverkoop"},"en":{"name":"Presale"},"de":{"name":"Vorverkauf"},"it":{"name":"Prevendita"},"sp":{"name":"Preventa"},"pt":{"name":"Pr\u00e9vente"},"cn":{"name":"Pr\u00e9vente"}},"value":10},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"},"de":{"name":"Article 27"},"it":{"name":"Article 27"},"sp":{"name":"Article 27"},"pt":{"name":"Article 27"},"cn":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-21T13:35:06+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-21T13:09:40+01:00","backoffice_id":272238,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"concert","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":548903,"date_start":"2023-03-23","date_end":"2023-03-26","date_next":"2023-03-24","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":84,"translations":{"fr":"Divers","nl":"Varia","en":"Various","de":"Verschiedenes","it":"Varie","sp":"Varios","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[89],"translations":{"fr":["Litt\u00e9rature"],"nl":["Literatuur"],"en":["Litterature "],"de":["Literatur"],"it":["Letteratura"],"sp":["Literatura"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Passa Porta Festival 2023","shortdescr":"Une centaine d\u2019\u00e9crivaines et d\u2019\u00e9crivains, de penseuses, penseurs et artistes investissant le centre de Bruxelles pour y faire vivre la litt\u00e9rature sous toutes ses formes : bienvenue au Passa Porta Festival ! Une neuvi\u00e8me \u00e9dition plac\u00e9e sous le signe du REFUGE.","longdescr":"Comme tous les deux ans, la Maison internationale des litt\u00e9ratures Passa Porta annonce une nouvelle \u00e9dition de son festival \u00e0 Bruxelles, \u00e9v\u00e9nement attendu de la vie litt\u00e9raire, et rassemblement litt\u00e9raire plurilingue le plus important d\u2019Europe.\r\n\r\n2023 marquera une \u00e9dition particuli\u00e8re pour ce rendez-vous bisannuel : cette ann\u00e9e, le Passa Porta Festival englobera l\u2019accueil, du 22 au 24 mars, par Passa Porta et la Ville de Bruxelles, de l\u2019\u00ab ICORN Network Meeting \u00bb, grand rassemblement annuel du r\u00e9seau international des villes-refuges pour \u00e9crivains, artistes et journalistes en exil. C\u2019est donc dans une v\u00e9ritable continuit\u00e9 que les deux \u00e9v\u00e9nements ont \u00e9t\u00e9 pens\u00e9s, et sous une th\u00e9matique partag\u00e9e : celle du REFUGE.\r\n\r\nUne th\u00e9matique particuli\u00e8rement inspirante que le festival d\u00e9clinera au fil d\u2019une soixantaine de programmes jetant des ponts entre romans et soci\u00e9t\u00e9, entre litt\u00e9rature et autres disciplines artistiques, entre auteur.rice.s belges et internationaux. Discussions, d\u00e9bats, lectures et performances : les \u00e9crivaines et \u00e9crivains partageront la sc\u00e8ne avec des essayistes, des musicien.e.s, des acteur.rice.s et d\u2019autres artistes autour d\u2019un seul objectif : offrir \u00e0 nos imaginaires et \u00e0 nos r\u00e9flexions de nouveaux refuges.\r\n\r\nEn m\u00eame temps que l\u2019annonce du festival, Passa Porta lance une vente de tickets au tarif pr\u00e9f\u00e9rentiel \u00ab early birds \u00bb du 8 d\u00e9cembre au 31 janvier inclus. Une perspective festive pour entamer 2023.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","email":"info@passaporta.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548903"},"nl":{"name":"Passa Porta Festival 2023","shortdescr":"Volgend jaar vieren een honderdtal schrijvers en kunstenaars weer het feest van de literatuur in vele vormen en talen in hartje Brussel: welkom op het Passa Porta Festival!","longdescr":"Om de twee jaar presenteert internationaal literatuurhuis Passa Porta een nieuwe editie van zijn bekende festival, het grootste meertalige Europese literatuurevenement waar velen steeds reikhalzend naar uitkijken.\r\n\r\nDitmaal wordt het een bijzondere editie, want van 22 tot 24 maart zijn Passa Porta en de Stad Brussel ook gastheer van de jaarlijkse bijeenkomst van het internationale netwerk van vluchtsteden voor bedreigde schrijvers, kunstenaars en journalisten in ballingschap. Deze ICORN Network Meeting en het Passa Porta Festival van 23 tot 26 maart sluiten op elkaar aan en delen een gemeenschappelijke thematiek: \u2018REFUGE\u2019.\r\n\r\nDe vele (bij)betekenissen van dit woord \u2014 onderdak, toevlucht, ballingschap, soelaas\u2026 \u2014 vormen een bron van inspiratie voor een zestigtal programma\u2019s op een tiental locaties in het centrum van Brussel. Auteurs, maar ook kunstenaars, muzikanten en acteurs leggen aan de hand van diverse gesprekken, lezingen en performances verbanden tussen literatuur en samenleving, tussen het boek en andere kunstvormen, en tussen literatuur uit binnen- en buitenland.\r\n\r\nTegelijk met deze aankondiging lanceert Passa Porta een \u2018early birds ticket\u2019 voor het festival. Wie er zeker bij wil zijn, kan van 8 december tot 31 januari een weekendpass kopen tegen een voordelige prijs.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","email":"info@passaporta.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548903"},"en":{"name":"Passa Porta Festival 2023","shortdescr":"A hundred writers, thinkers and artists taking over the centre of Brussels to bring literature in all its forms to life: welcome to the Passa Porta Festival! The theme of the ninth edition is REFUGE.","longdescr":"As it does every two years, the International House of Literature Passa Porta is pleased to announce a new edition of its festival in Brussels, an eagerly awaited event in the literary world and the most important multilingual literary gathering in Europe.\r\n\r\n2023 will mark a special edition for this biennial event: this year, the Passa Porta Festival will include the hosting, from 22 to 24 March, by Passa Porta and the City of Brussels, of the ICORN Network Meeting, a major annual gathering of the International Cities of Refuge Network for writers, artists and journalists in exile. The two events were therefore conceived in line with each other and around a shared theme: that of REFUGE.\r\n\r\nA particularly inspiring theme that the festival will develop through some sixty programmes building bridges between novels and society, between literature and other artistic disciplines, between Belgian and international authors. Discussions, debates, readings and performances: writers will share the stage with essayists, musicians, actors and other artists with a single objective: to offer our imaginations and our thoughts new refuges.\r\n\r\nThe announcement of the festival by Passa Porta coincides with the launch of the sale of \u2018early bird\u2019 tickets. These tickets at a preferential rate will be on sale from 8 December to 31 January. A festive perspective to start 2023.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","email":"info@passaporta.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548903"},"de":{"name":"Passa Porta Festival 2023","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","email":"info@passaporta.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548903"},"it":{"name":"Passa Porta Festival 2023","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","email":"info@passaporta.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548903"},"sp":{"name":"Passa Porta Festival 2023","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","email":"info@passaporta.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548903"},"pt":{"name":"Passa Porta Festival 2023","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","email":"info@passaporta.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548903"},"cn":{"name":"Passa Porta Festival 2023","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","email":"info@passaporta.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548903"}},"place":{"id":240645,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Passa Porta","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@passaporta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 226 04 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 46","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Passa Porta est la maison internationale des litt\u00e9ratures \u00e0 Bruxelles. Fond\u00e9e en 2004 sous l\u2019impulsion des organisations litt\u00e9raires Het beschrijf et Entrez Lire, elle est aujourd\u2019hui un lieu unique en son genre, au c\u0153ur de l\u2019Europe. Une maison plurillingue qui permet aux auteurs, lecteurs, traducteurs et autres amoureux litt\u00e9raires de se rencontrer et de s\u2019inspirer mutuellement. \r\nRencontres litt\u00e9raires (intra et extra muros), d\u00e9bats d\u2019id\u00e9es, cr\u00e9ations de textes, clubs de lecture, traductions, collectif de po\u00e8tes\u2026 Passa Porta se veut \u00e0 la fois exigeante et ouverte \u00e0 tous. La maison g\u00e8re \u00e9galement un programme international pour les \u00e9crivains en r\u00e9sidence. \r\nLe festival Passa Porta (un des plus prestigieux d\u2019Europe), a lieu tous les deux ans et attire plusieurs milliers de curieux et\/ou passionn\u00e9s dans une vingtaine de lieux culturels bruxellois. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Passa Porta","address_street_name":"Antoine Dansaertstraat","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@passaporta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 226 04 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Antoine Dansaertstraat, 46","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Passa Porta is het internationale literatuurhuis in Brussel. Het werd opgericht in 2004 door literaire organisaties Het beschrijf en Entrez Lire en heeft sindsdien een unieke plek ingenomen in het hart van Europa. Passa Porta is een meertalig huis, een werk- en ontmoetingsplek voor auteurs, lezers, vertalers en andere literatuurliefhebbers uit de hele wereld. \r\nNaast literaire ontmoetingen (intra en extra muros), leesclubs, en diverse creatieprojecten voor auteurs en vertalers, ontwikkelt Passa Porta ook een internationaal programma voor writers-in-residence.\r\nHet tweejaarlijkse Passa Porta Festival, h\u00e9t internationale literatuurfestival van Belgi\u00eb, is zeer gewaardeerd in heel Europa en trekt vele duizenden bezoekers. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Passa Porta","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@passaporta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.passaporta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 226 04 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 46","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Passa Porta is the international house of literature in Brussels. Founded in 2004 by the organizations Het beschrijf and Entrez Lire, it is a multilingual organization in the heart of Europe. A unique place where all kinds of literature lovers, authors, readers, translators and cultural mediators can meet and work.\r\nIt offers literary encounters, creative projects for authors and translators and an international program for writers in residence. \r\nPassa Porta also organizes the biennial Passa Porta Festival, one of the most prestigious literary festivals in Europe. It attracts thousands of visitors to more than twenty locations in Brussels.     \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Passa Porta","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@passaporta.be","w