alue":10},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Jeunes"},"nl":{"name":"Jongeren"},"en":{"name":"Young people"},"de":{"name":"Jugendliche"},"it":{"name":"Ragazzi"},"sp":{"name":"J\u00f3venes"},"pt":{"name":"Jeunes"},"cn":{"name":"Jeunes"}},"value":10}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-25T02:35:20+01:00","published_at":"2023-01-03T13:21:45+01:00","backoffice_id":268336,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"concert","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.18051655059781},{"id":552239,"date_start":"2023-03-25","date_end":"2023-03-25","date_next":"2023-03-25","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert","it":"Concerti","sp":"Concierto","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"de":["Pop, Rock, Jazz...","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"it":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk e Country"],"sp":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, folk y country"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Saturday Night","shortdescr":"Venez d\u00e9couvrir et \u00e9changer autour de la musique \u201cold-time\u201d, tradition am\u00e9ricaine dont la pratique bien vivante a essaim\u00e9 jusqu\u2019en Europe.","longdescr":"Ce week-end th\u00e9matique vous est propos\u00e9 pour vous immerger dans cette culture aux atours simples mais demandant de s\u2019y plonger pour comprendre son attrait : la construction d\u2019un rythme et d\u2019une m\u00e9lodie \u00e0 l\u2019unisson, faite pour emporter, dans la danse et en musique, les pieds des participant.es.\r\n\r\nLe week-end d\u00e9butera le vendredi par une soir\u00e9e de projection documentaire et une conf\u00e9rence avec en cl\u00f4ture une pratique du Sacred Harp et une Jam.\r\n\r\nLe samedi, venez \u00e9couter le concert des professeurs de l\u2019acad\u00e9mie de Muziekpublique et participez ensuite \u00e0 l\u2019initiation de \u2018Square dance\u2019, une danse old-time qui se pratique \u00e0 plusieurs en carr\u00e9. Une plong\u00e9e dans la culture folk des Etats-Unis et de leurs origines !\r\n\r\nDes stages seront propos\u00e9s pendant tout le week-end. Voir le programme complet sur la page des stages.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552239"},"nl":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Saturday Night","shortdescr":"Lang voor de country en bluegrass op een moderne manier de wereld veroverden, deed de muziek van kleine gemeenschappen van boeren en vervolgens mijnwerkers in het oosten van de Verenigde Staten al dansen en dromen.","longdescr":"Deze rurale muziek kwam begin twintigste eeuw de ether binnen onder de naam Hillbilly Music en later \u201cold-time\u201d. De oorsprong is terug te vinden in de Europese en Afrikaanse folktradities van waaruit zich verschillende dansen en ballads en andere liedjes ontstonden. Sinds enkele jaren ontwikkelt zich in de Verenigde Staten en nu ook in West-Europa een nieuwe generatie van old time muzikanten. Ook in ons land is de stijl aan een revival toe en er ontstond een Belgische scene, met uitwisseling over de grenzen.\r\n\r\nOp zaterdag spelen de leerkrachten van de stages en is er een old time bal.\r\n\r\nGedurende het hele weekend zullen er workshops plaatsvinden gerelateerd aan de American Roots muziek. Meer info over de workshops vind je hier.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552239"},"en":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Saturday Night","shortdescr":"Come discover and discuss \u201cold-time\u201d music, an American tradition whose lively practice has spread to Europe.","longdescr":"This themed weekend is proposed to you to immerse yourself in this culture with simple finery but requiring you to immerse yourself in it to understand its appeal: the construction of a rhythm and a melody in unison, made to take away, in dance and music, the feet of the participants.\r\n\r\nThe weekend will begin on Friday with an evening of documentary screening and a conference with a Sacred Harp practice and a Jam at the end.\r\n\r\nOn Saturday, come and listen to the concert by the teachers of the Muziekpublique academy and then take part in the initiation of 'Square dance', an old-time dance that is practiced in a square with several people. A dive into the folk culture of the United States and their origins!\r\n\r\nWorkshops will be offered throughout the weekend. See the full program on the courses page.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552239"},"de":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Saturday Night","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552239"},"it":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Saturday Night","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552239"},"sp":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Saturday Night","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552239"},"pt":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Saturday Night","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552239"},"cn":{"name":"American Roots Weekend - Saturday Night","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552239"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 