},"cn":{"title":"Visite guid\u00e9e graffiti et street art","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-03-25","doors":null,"start":"14:00:00","end":"15:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":10}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-28T11:05:06+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-28T10:55:09+01:00","backoffice_id":272631,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":551778,"date_start":"2023-03-25","date_end":"2023-03-25","date_next":"2023-03-25","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert","it":"Concerti","sp":"Concierto","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"de":["Pop, Rock, Jazz...","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"it":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk e Country"],"sp":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, folk y country"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"3'Ain - Brosella Spring Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Jazz du monde avec des influences du Moyen-Orient\r\nYamen Martini (trompette), Otto Kint (contrebasse) et Piet Maris (accord\u00e9on).\r\n\r\nEn 2015, Yamen quitte la Syrie pour la Belgique, o\u00f9 il rencontre Piet. Ensemble, ils commencent \u00e0 travailler sur la musique d'une pi\u00e8ce de th\u00e9\u00e2tre en 2016. Par la suite, Piet a invit\u00e9 Yamen en tant que musicien invit\u00e9 avec Jaune Toujours, \u00e0 la fois en live et sur leur album Europeana (2018). L'\u00e9t\u00e9 2019, Yamen et Piet ont demand\u00e9 \u00e0 Otto de se joindre \u00e0 eux dans leur \u00e9change musical et de cette union est n\u00e9 3'Ain.\r\n\r\nLeur nom est bas\u00e9 sur \ufec9, qui est la dix-huiti\u00e8me lettre de l'alphabet arabe, \u00e9galement l'une des voyelles la plus difficile \u00e0 prononcer pour les occidentaux. Comme il est souvent indiqu\u00e9 en arabe dans les conversations par chat et par SMS sous la forme 3 et en translitt\u00e9ration sous la forme 'ain, 3'Ain semblait \u00eatre un nom appropri\u00e9 pour un trio jouant du jazz du monde contemporain avec des influences du Moyen-Orient.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/brosellaspringfestival.be\/nl\/artist\/3ain\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551778"},"nl":{"name":"3'Ain - Brosella Spring Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Worldwide jazz met middenoosterse invloeden\r\nYamen Martini (trompet), Otto Kint (contrabas) en Piet Maris (accordeon).\r\n\r\nIn 2015 verhuisde Yamen van Syri\u00eb naar Belgi\u00eb, waar hij Piet ontmoette: samen werkten ze in 2016 aan muziek voor een theaterstuk. Daarna nodigde Piet Yamen uit als gastmuzikant bij Jaune Toujours, zowel live als op hun album Europeana (2018). In de zomer van 2019 vroegen Yamen en Piet aan Otto om mee te  stappen in hun muzikale avontuur en zo werd 3'Ain geboren.\r\n\r\nDe naam van het trio is gebaseerd op \ufec9, de achttiende letter van het Arabische alfabet, ook een van de moeilijkste klinkers om uit te spreken voor westerlingen. In Arabische chat- en sms-gesprekken wordt de letter vaak als 3 aangeduid, en in de transliteratie als 'ain. 3'Ain leek dan ook een toepasselijke naam voor een trio dat hedendaagse worldwide jazz met middenoosterse invloeden speelt.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/brosellaspringfestival.be\/nl\/artist\/3ain\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551778"},"en":{"name":"3'Ain - Brosella Spring Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Worldwide Jazz with an Oriental Twist\r\nYamen Martini (trompet), Otto Kint (contrabas) en Piet Maris (accordeon).\r\n\r\nIn 2015 Yamen moved from Syria to Belgium, where he met Piet: the two started working together on music for a theatre play in 2016.\r\nLateron, Piet invited Yamen to play and record as a guest musician with Jaune Toujours, as you can hear on their most recent album Europeana (2018).\r\nSummer of 2019, they asked Otto to join in on their musical exchange, starting up a new trio.\r\n\r\nThe band name is based on \ufec9\u200e, which is the eighteenth letter of the Arabic alphabet, one of the most difficult vowels to pronounce for western people. As it is often indicated in Arabic chat- and SMS-conversation as 3, and in transliteration as 'ain, 3'Ain seemed an appropriate name for a trio playing contemporary jazz and world with oriental influences.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/brosellaspringfestival.be\/nl\/artist\/3ain\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551778"},"de":{"name":"3'ain - Brosella Spring Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/brosellaspringfestival.be\/nl\/artist\/3ain\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551778"},"