lse,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert","it":"Concerti","sp":"Concierto","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"fr":["Classique"],"nl":["Klassiek"],"en":["Classical"],"de":["Klassisch"],"it":["Classica"],"sp":["Cl\u00e1sica"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["en","fr","de"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Concert de printemps","shortdescr":"Concert de printemps de la Brussels Choral Society\r\n\r\nProgramme :\r\nAntonio Vivaldi, Gloria (RV 589)\r\nJoseph Haydn, Te Deum (Hob. XXIIIc:2)\r\nTom Cunningham, Cantata for Peace (premi\u00e8re mondiale)\r\nAlex Berko, You through me (premi\u00e8re europ\u00e9enne)","longdescr":"Tout comme ses Quatre Saisons pour orchestre, le Gloria RV 589 de Vivaldi est la pi\u00e8ce de musique parfaite pour accueillir le printemps, un souffle d\u2019air frais apr\u00e8s l\u2019hiver. La Brussels Choral Society (BCS) associ\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019Ensemble Orchestral de Bruxelles vous invite \u00e0 son concert de printemps au Conservatoire de Bruxelles durant lequel elle chantera le Gloria de Vivaldi et le Te Deum de Haydn. Le programme du concert comprend \u00e9galement la premi\u00e8re mondiale de Cantata for Peace, \u00e9crite par Tom Cunningham, ancien directeur musical de la BCS et la premi\u00e8re europ\u00e9enne de You through me, \u0153uvre du jeune compositeur am\u00e9ricain Alex Berko consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 un jardin","performers":"Brussels Choral Society\r\nEnsemble Orchestral de Bruxelles\r\nEric Delson - Conductor\r\nSarah Van Mol - Soprano\r\nDagmara Dobrowolska - Alto","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.brusselschoralsociety.com\/concert-calendar\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552452"},"nl":{"name":"Voorjaarsconcert","shortdescr":"Voorjaarsconcert van de Brussels Choral Society\r\n\r\nProgramma :\r\nAntonio Vivaldi, Gloria (RV 589)\r\nJoseph Haydn, Te Deum (Hob. XXIIIc:2)\r\nTom Cunningham, Cantata for Peace (Wereldpremi\u00e8re)\r\nAlex Berko, You through me (Europese premi\u00e8re)","longdescr":"Net als zijn Vier Jaargetijden voor orkest is Antonio Vivaldi\u2019s Gloria RV 589 bij uitstek geschikte muziek om het voorjaar mee te verwelkomen \u2013 een fris nieuw begin na de winter. De Brussels Choral Society (BCS) en het Ensemble Orchestral de Bruxelles nodigen u uit voor hun voorjaarsconcert in het Conservatorium van Brussel. Op het programma staat naast Vivaldi\u2019s Gloria ook een Te Deum van Joseph Haydn. Tevens stellen wij in dit concert twee nieuwe werken aan u voor: de wereldpremi\u00e8re van de Cantata for Peace van Tom Cunningham, de vroegere muzikale leider van de BCS, en de Europese premi\u00e8re van You through me van de hand van de jonge Amerikaanse componist Alex Berko.","performers":"Brussels Choral Society\r\nEnsemble Orchestral de Bruxelles\r\nEric Delson - Conductor\r\nSarah Van Mol - Soprano","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.brusselschoralsociety.com\/concert-calendar\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552452"},"en":{"name":"Spring Concert","shortdescr":"Spring Concert of the Brussels Choral Society\r\n\r\nProgramme:\r\nAntonio Vivaldi, Gloria (RV 589)\r\nJoseph Haydn, Te Deum (Hob. XXIIIc:2)\r\nTom Cunningham, Cantata for Peace (world premiere)\r\nAlex Berko, You through me (European premiere)","longdescr":"Just like his Four Seasons for orchestra, Antonio Vivaldi\u2019s Gloria RV 589 is the perfect music to welcome spring\u2009\u2013\u2009a breath of fresh air after the winter. The Brussels Choral Society (BCS), together with the Ensemble Orchestral de Bruxelles invites you to their spring concert in the Royal Conservatoire of Brussels, performing Vivaldi\u2019s Gloria and Haydn\u2019s Te Deum. The programme also includes the world premiere of the Cantata for Peace written by Tom Cunningham, the BCS\u2019s former musical director, and the European premiere of You through me, a piece about a garden, by the young American composer Alex Berko.","performers":"Brussels Choral Society\r\nEnsemble Orchestral de Bruxelles\r\nEric Delson - Conductor\r\nSarah Van Mol - Soprano","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.brusselschoralsociety.com\/concert-calendar\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552452"},"de":{"name":"Concert de Printemps","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.brusselschoralsociety.com\/concert-calendar\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552452"},"it":{"name":"Concert de Printemps","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.brusselschoralsociety.com\/concert-calendar\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552452"},"sp":{"name":"Concert de Printemps","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.brusselschoralsociety.com\/concert-calendar\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552452"},"pt":{"name":"Concert de Printemps","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.brusselschoralsociety.com\/concert-calendar\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552452"},"cn":{"name":"Concert de Printemps","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.brusselschoralsociety.com\/concert-calendar\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552452"}},"place":{"id":265522,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 30","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Conservatoire royal de Bruxelles organise pr\u00e8s de 200 \u00e9v\u00e9nements (hors \u00e9valuations publiques) chaque saison, offrant ainsi aux \u00e9tudiants le temps de l\u2019\u00e9change avec le public. Concerts symphoniques dans la grande salle du Conservatoire, ou rencontres plus intimes \u00e0 l\u2019Auditorium Joseph Jongen et dans les lieux partenaires du Conservatoire, de nombreuses occasions leurs permettent d'appr\u00e9hender la sc\u00e8ne, encadr\u00e9s par leurs enseignants ou en \u00e9lectrons libres lors des Nocturnes ou du festival Courants d\u2019airs.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Regentschapsstraat","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Regentschapsstraat, 30","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De meeste concerten georganiseerd door het KCB zijn gratis toegankelijk, voor sommige echter wordt een inkomprijs gevraagd om de professionele omkadering van de verschillende projecten voor de studenten te financieren. Bijzondere concerten zijn ondermeer het Nieuwjaarsconcert met feestelijke ontvangst, musicalvoorstellingen als eigen productie van het KCB, concerten in samenwerking met de Koninklijke Muziekkapel van De Gidsen en  benefietconcerten. De reservatie voor alle betalende concerten is mogelijk via BOZAR.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/en\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 30","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Concert Society (Concertvereniging) vzw was born in the lap of the Brussels Royal Conservatory. Each year the Society programmes a series of concerts in which the students at the Conservatory get the chance to gain experience of performing on stage. Teachers and students work together intensively to prepare for these concerts, an experience which undoubtedly makes a positive contribution to the students' education.\r\nMany initiatives take place in co-production with other institutions and musical societies such as the Royal College of Music in London, the Conservatoire national sup\u00e9rieur de musique of Paris, the Musikhochschulen of Vienna, Graz and Cologne, the Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles, the Koninklijke Conservatoria in Rotterdam and in Den Haag, the Lemmensinstituut in Louvain, the Filharmonische Vereniging van Brussel, Europalia, and the arts festivals \"Ars Musica\" and \"De barokke Lente van de Zavel\".\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_li