en en culturele evenementen. De kapel, die uitkijkt over het plein met zijn tweehonderdjarige lindeboom, is een plaats van nabijheid met een warme en intieme sfeer.","description_print":"Deze voormalige ontheiligde kapel, gelegen in het zuiden van Elsene, in het hart van de wijk Boondael, biedt nu onderdak aan tentoonstellingen, concerten en culturele evenementen. De kapel, die uitkijkt over het plein met zijn tweehonderdjarige lindeboom, is een plaats van nabijheid met een warme en intieme sfeer.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre d'Art de la Chapelle de Boondael","address_street_name":"Square du Vieux Tilleul","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"culture@ixelles.brussels","website":"https:\/\/culture.ixelles.be\/en\/art-boondael\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 64 63","phone_booking":"+32 2 515 64 63","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Square du Vieux Tilleul, 10","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Located in the south of Ixelles, in the heart of the Boondael district, this desacralized chapel now hosts exhibitions, concerts and cultural events. Overlooking the square and its 200-year-old lime tree, the chapel is a place of proximity with a warm and intimate atmosphere.","description_print":"Located in the south of Ixelles, in the heart of the Boondael district, this desacralized chapel now hosts exhibitions, concerts and cultural events. Overlooking the square and its 200-year-old lime tree, the chapel is a place of proximity with a warm and intimate atmosphere.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Chapelle de Boondael","address_street_name":"Square du Vieux Tilleul","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"culture@ixelles.brussels","website":"https:\/\/culture.ixelles.be\/fr\/art-boondael\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 64 63","phone_booking":"+32 2 515 64 63","address_zip":"1050","address_city