],"de":["Theater"],"it":["Teatro"],"sp":["Teatro"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Nous savons tous aujourd\u2019hui, bien mieux qu\u2019auparavant, ce que peuvent \u00eatre les privations de libert\u00e9s, la perte des rep\u00e8res et autres changements d\u2019habitudes. Bouleversements soudains et brutaux que nous n\u2019avons pas choisis mais dont on est bien oblig\u00e9 de subir les cons\u00e9quences.\r\n\r\nAvec son nouveau spectacle, Ben Hamidou nous parle, avec l\u2019humour et la tendresse qu\u2019on lui conna\u00eet, des temp\u00eates qui l\u2019avaient brusquement \u00e9loign\u00e9 de ses proches. Il n\u2019avait que sept ans quand il fut \u00e9loign\u00e9 de sa famille ! Envoy\u00e9 seul loin de Bruxelles, dans une campagne d\u00e9serte, o\u00f9 boudins, compotes et autres rollmops remplac\u00e8rent les d\u00e9licieux tajines de sa grand-m\u00e8re.\r\n\r\nHeureusement, il a surv\u00e9cu pour nous dire comment y parvenir !","performers":"Avec Ben Hamidou | Texte Ben Hamidou, Gennaro Pitisci et Ma\u00eft\u00e9 Renson | Mise en sc\u00e8ne Gennaro Pitisci, assist\u00e9 de Ma\u00eft\u00e9 Renson | R\u00e9gie : David Vernaillen, Josse Derbaix, Claude Taymans.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"nl":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"en":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"de":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"it":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"sp":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"pt":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"cn":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"}},"place":{"id":247296,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Centre culturel Espace Magh asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Poin\u00e7on","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@espacemagh.be","website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Poin\u00e7on","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"L\u2019Espace Magh est un centre culturel situ\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles dont l\u2019objectif est de promouvoir les cultures du bassin m\u00e9diterran\u00e9en. Sa sp\u00e9cificit\u00e9 est \u00e0 la fois de porter une attention particuli\u00e8re aux cultures dites minoritaires, d\u2019\u00eatre \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9coute des artistes issus des immigrations, trop souvent m\u00e9connus, et, enfin, d\u2019agir comme une chambre d\u2019\u00e9cho pour un certain nombre d\u2019auteurs du Sud ou d\u2019ailleurs, \u00e9tonnants autant qu\u2019ignor\u00e9s, qui n\u2019ont pas trouv\u00e9 asile ailleurs. Lieu de cr\u00e9ation, de production et de diffusion, l\u2019Espace Magh propose une programmation ouverte, contemporaine et pluridisciplinaire, ainsi que des ateliers et des stages. Ce programme a pour but de contribuer au rayonnement des expressions multiculturelles, artistiques, intellectuelles et litt\u00e9raires.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Centre culturel Espace Magh asbl","address_street_name":"Priemstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@espacemagh.be","website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Priemstraat","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre culturel Espace Magh asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Poin\u00e7on","address_street_number":null,"address_stre