g","width":1080,"height":1080,"ratio":1,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Club de lecture cor\u00e9en \u2013 '' Amande '', de Won-Pyung Sohn","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Club de lecture cor\u00e9en \u2013 '' Amande '', de Won-Pyung Sohn","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Club de lecture cor\u00e9en \u2013 '' Amande '', de Won-Pyung Sohn","copyright":null},"de":{"title":"Club de lecture cor\u00e9en \u2013 '' Amande '', de Won-Pyung Sohn","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Club de lecture cor\u00e9en \u2013 '' Amande '', de Won-Pyung Sohn","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Club de lecture cor\u00e9en \u2013 '' Amande '', de Won-Pyung Sohn","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Club de lecture cor\u00e9en \u2013 '' Amande '', de Won-Pyung Sohn","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Club de lecture cor\u00e9en \u2013 '' Amande '', de Won-Pyung Sohn","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-03-30","doors":null,"start":"19:00:00","end":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":0}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-18T04:06:42+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-15T10:27:48+01:00","backoffice_id":271756,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"misc","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":552998,"date_start":"2023-03-30","date_end":"2023-04-02","date_next":"2023-03-30","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre","de":"Theater","it":"Teatro","sp":"Teatro","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"],"de":["Theater"],"it":["Teatro"],"sp":["Teatro"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Second Souffle","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Deux grenouilles se d\u00e9battent dans un bocal de lait. L\u2019une abandonne et meurt. L\u2019autre, \u00e0 force de battre des pattes, transforme le lait en beurre et sort du pot.\r\n\r\nMorgane Raoux est clarinettiste. Passionn\u00e9e. Et promise \u00e0 un bel avenir : op\u00e9ras nationaux, grands orchestres symphoniques. \u00c0 25 ans, un pneumothorax stoppe net sa trajectoire fulgurante. Et sa grande carri\u00e8re \u00e0 peine entam\u00e9e. Morgane a perdu le souffle\u2026\r\n\r\nAvec Second Souffle, elle traite de sa r\u00e9silience heureuse et profitable. De l\u2019optimisme galopant qu\u2019elle utilise comme un bazooka. Finalement, il n\u2019est question ici que d\u2019espoir. De vivre plut\u00f4t que de survivre. D\u2019entendre le sang bouillir dans les veines et de sentir la belle sant\u00e9 nous traverser. A l\u2019instar de la pierre philosophale, Morgane a su transformer la mis\u00e8re en joyau.\r\n\r\nSecond Souffle est l\u2019adaptation th\u00e9\u00e2trale du premier roman de Morgane Raoux Je ne souffle pas, je chante.\r\n\r\nNous avons mesur\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019aune des r\u00e9actions des lecteurs et lectrices combien le livre est plus que n\u00e9cessaire car il diffuse, autant que des pulsions vitales, un formidable espoir. Ce qui, par extension, pourrait \u00eatre une denr\u00e9e rare aujourd\u2019hui\u2026.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.poche.be","email":"reservation@poche.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 649 17 27","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552998"},"nl":{"name":"S